url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/b2d5361a1d60ffe9357577b4e3e80ef74b5fabe1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T16:28:44Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T16:28:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/distributed tasks (#646)\n\n## 🚀 Distributed Task Management\n\nIntroduces a transport-agnostic task-runner with an in-process and a\nRedis Streams\nbackend, blob storage abstractions, REST/WS endpoints, and a browser\nclient SDK.\n\n### ✨ Highlights\n- Task lifecycle with retry/backoff, cancellation cascade, orphan\nreaping, and replay\n- Redis Streams adapter: delayed dispatch, broker-side reclaim,\nfleet-wide concurrency caps\n- Blob store with in-memory / filesystem / S3 adapters and presigned\nupload tickets\n- New ESLint rule enforcing handler determinism for safe replay\n\n### ⚠️ Breaking Changes\n- `cross-node-bus`: `CrossNodeBusCapabilities.crossNodeDelivery` is now\nrequired\n- `redis-store`: key layout changed; existing data must be migrated","tree":{"sha":"90b1e24bb88b27ef42d26d7cd563ed2f5772786c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/90b1e24bb88b27ef42d26d7cd563ed2f5772786c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/b2d5361a1d60ffe9357577b4e3e80ef74b5fabe1","verification":{"payload":"tree 90b1e24bb88b27ef42d26d7cd563ed2f5772786c\nparent f778725f84dd2e6eaeca4c714d430d6f214b1acd\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1780676924 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780676924 +0200\n\nFeat/distributed tasks (#646)\n\n## 🚀 Distributed Task Management\n\nIntroduces a transport-agnostic task-runner with an in-process and a\nRedis Streams\nbackend, blob storage abstractions, REST/WS endpoints, and a browser\nclient SDK.\n\n### ✨ Highlights\n- Task lifecycle with retry/backoff, cancellation cascade, orphan\nreaping, and replay\n- Redis Streams adapter: delayed dispatch, broker-side reclaim,\nfleet-wide concurrency caps\n- Blob store with in-memory / filesystem / S3 adapters and presigned\nupload tickets\n- New ESLint rule enforcing handler determinism for safe replay\n\n### ⚠️ Breaking Changes\n- `cross-node-bus`: `CrossNodeBusCapabilities.crossNodeDelivery` is now\nrequired\n- `redis-store`: key layout changed; existing data must be migrated","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIvk8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALK8QAAWzNLGzdqRYbfBJf3I7RWKA\nYaGHQBPY8G89m/9DILLGq9VP8aA3yGeonxIWrmNv/r4UpG0d0m5ofshX1ms6TZzs\n4eE3352z8xzxqILrPUYsrSRw4/kIvza9TwgUsqVaGImpHqZ8oChoGbPZTMn/2e87\nN7O6wd9uedqRdzjNOPQ6Cxsz2HwXTGS31rmBFu7VZC8tkTLVE3j5ICCDy7MjCfEh\nRhleBz0q0sCwKQqyX7EuoQTYy2k9GijmP8jU40ncFiRVRDkrbl09OyzWDpqLZbU/\n9Lekq8y8UrMcIqiIqt3bnajkuUVe8ArnrgOJ+9qmj364xibBO9miWqnBs45M6AAC\nYC2Q26E6JhFd1fYw/5VKbsC2HSagBf0rNn8yUEIAcnHNasx69pZUApSnQjqSLDm0\nlFJUmjLImvmuQ93sl5bWnbVN/fXGMycv2YXQAmJ+ClJr/+TRNUenITjm8WWNQCVg\nMYtxFza/N9+q3k7YIoS5wO2QItN6XXYD3vsVSKZb/3XelGUII1hqaqD29btKjTZo\n3ERK/PtWNUuu8HGv2dFfs9RACF7/+X1fsYESCvDWlf4KrQCxe7CUWdfSlUDmB36m\nx73rHIPDpkReedrZu7IfMVZmh+hCocqqGcAV4Ya2p8/1ciwyE2Cypq3EMgw0zv7d\nRlzp6cUB4c5s/rH/7eyz\n=DDu4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-05T16:28:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/we