3NzA1NDcxYmI3N2EzYmRkMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/a985aad9fc895944ac37a0f584bf4760f12cbf45","sha":"a985aad9fc895944ac37a0f584bf4760f12cbf45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/a985aad9fc895944ac37a0f584bf4760f12cbf45"}],"sha":"e6794d260ee31e5bd100bc7705471bb77a3bdd16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/e6794d260ee31e5bd100bc7705471bb77a3bdd16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/a985aad9fc895944ac37a0f584bf4760f12cbf45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T11:44:38Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T11:44:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/cross node bus (#645)\n\n## 🚌 Cross Node Bus\n\nImplements the cross-node pub/sub primitive described in\n`docs/internal/cross-node-bus-spike.md` and the two facades that ride on\ntop of it (`IdentityEventBus`, `EntityChangeBus`), plus the Redis\nStreams adapter and a multi-service smoke harness.\n\n## 📦 What ships\n\n- `@furystack/cross-node-bus` — `CrossNodeBus` token, in-process\ndefault, `MemoryBroker`, telemetry hooks,\n`@furystack/cross-node-bus/testing` harness.\n- `@furystack/redis-cross-node-bus` — Redis Streams adapter (`XADD` +\nplain `XREAD`, no consumer groups), `defineRedisCrossNodeBusAdapter`,\n`compareRedisStreamId`.\n- `@furystack/rest-service` — `IdentityEventBus` facade;\n`UserResolutionCache.invalidateByUser`; centralised\n`identity-cache-keys`.\n- `@furystack/entity-sync-service` — `EntityChangeBus` facade;\n`SubscriptionManager` rebased onto the bus; bus-backed `ChangeLog` for\ndelta replay; per-(model, originId) dedup.\n- `@furystack/entity-sync` / `@furystack/entity-sync-client` —\nwire-format change: `seq` is now an opaque string (major bump).\n- `@furystack/websocket-api` — closes WS on cross-node `userLoggedOut`.","tree":{"sha":"6a06469370425b71519e655ca8a7d3f90b25e56b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/6a06469370425b71519e655ca8a7d3f90b25e56b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/a985aad9fc895944ac37a0f584bf4760f12cbf45","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a06469370425b71519e655ca8a7d3f90b25e56b\nparent 674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1777808678 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777808678 +0200\n\nFeat/cross node bus (#645)\n\n## 🚌 Cross Node Bus\n\nImplements the cross-node pub/sub primitive described in\n`docs/internal/cross-node-bus-spike.md` and the two facades that ride on\ntop of it (`IdentityEventBus`, `EntityChangeBus`), plus the Redis\nStreams adapter and a multi-service smoke harness.\n\n## 📦 What ships\n\n- `@furystack/cross-node-bus` — `CrossNodeBus` token, in-process\ndefault, `MemoryBroker`, telemetry hooks,\n`@furystack/cross-node-bus/testing` harness.\n- `@furystack/redis-cross-node-bus` — Redis Streams adapter (`XADD` +\nplain `XREAD`, no consumer groups), `defineRedisCrossNodeBusAdapter`,\n`compareRedisStreamId`.\n- `@furystack/rest-service` — `IdentityEventBus` facade;\n`UserResolutionCache.invalidateByUser`; centralised\n`identity-cache-keys`.\n- `@furystack/entity-sync-service` — `EntityChangeBus` facade;\n`SubscriptionManager` rebased onto the bus; bus-backed `ChangeLog` for\ndelta replay; per-(model, originId) dedup.\n- `@furystack/entity-sync` / `@furystack/entity-sync-client` —\nwire-format change: `seq` is now an opaque string (major bump).\n- `@furystack/websocket-api` — closes WS on cross-node `userLoggedOut`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp9zUmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAevEQAKESNt5oZW8ocTkNZvFEwPW6\nwNjc9Uw9q7yJfVA5YHw0aRC59u0OkFDpbvajgh1WqpIV1iAvk4kTzIyn3Zg9wiKH\njX6JQiUTSssCo63ThF23CX1GndwLA3sG36hSvfxEc6m5qm2Fwxu/n8maQBRU65x9\nON7YoAx9TQY/2nduzoupwa16T29cV2fAqvdz4nIBmyQQjDzkjzVT1rgQmoOYJwMn\ndUsIPlqWFr5u6RPT8cwWs5GJWR63bo3x1buusfbh4fKWy2ycSEt5d175tIYSlPjx\n33t1wTk+Pu7YmmSk2SY/Ul2ol9uFA8PHaby9frhiL4DdqfxHXUH7zB0cNoCca4DB\nniiPXh+B8wLtIf6qAPC2ORiaAg6tM4BcXfnlWr53hUZCXGALCwfdJobxPwGYh1zq\nP9/zpUHKdFTGd6emQX3DGND/nFLjNpBjQopPihKHUUxaP25A5D2utQKZLeaWUu0x\nHgTr7+S5+nleVeNxhZ1mcLtNzPg4ALMdwDsbEF/U8CJJKpvzs1Wih/bktP2YF3IY\nUSLFiahojOJruJ/Z0SbkRRxy7PrskpE8sHKa+ED2rqLAU2BClD1+vkyQra0hD5Yx\nmcIHVsSvnddRuDV9dTryOIJ5fP/wC5gjuKUEv+s6zRggvoAxc0rdxZ+25DO9fq62\nafQxhWEUZW6W1IM0qy5V\n=xY6i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-03T11:44:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/a985aad9fc895944ac37a0f584bf4760f12cbf45","node_id":"C_kwDOCYZLQNoAKGE5ODVhYWQ5ZmM4OTU5NDRhYzM3YTBmNTg0YmY0NzYwZjEyY2JmNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6","sha":"674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6"}],"sha":"a985aad9fc895944ac37a0f584bf4760f12cbf45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/a985aad9fc895944ac37a0f584bf4760f12cbf45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T13:55:32Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T13:55:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/serializable cache (#644)\n\n## 🎯 Summary\n\nReplaces the predicate-based range invalidation APIs on `Cache` with a\nserializable, tag-based invalidation scheme designed to be replayed\nacross\nprocesses over a future cross-node event bus. Adds a `TTag extends\nstring`\ngeneric so callers can constrain tags to a string-literal union.\n\n## 🧩 Changes\n\n- **Breaking:** remove `Cache.obsoleteRange(predicate)` and\n`Cache.removeRange(predicate)`.\n- Add `CacheSettings.getTags?: (value, ...args) => readonly TTag[]`,\nrecomputed on every successful load.\n- Add `Cache.obsoleteByTag(tag)` and `Cache.removeByTag(tag)` with count\nreturn values.\n- `CacheStateManager` now owns a `tagIndex: Map<string, Set<string>>`,\nkept in sync on set / remove / LRU eviction / flushAll.\n- README + cache changelog updated; cross-node-bus internal doc promoted\nfrom spike to PRD v1.","tree":{"sha":"ee2c7faee4aabf23a2c4e6fc0e49fe4591b01ca4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/ee2c7faee4aabf23a2c4e6fc0e49fe4591b01ca4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6","verification":{"payload":"tree ee2c7faee4aabf23a2c4e6fc0e49fe4591b01ca4\nparent 1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1777730132 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777730132 +0000\n\nFeat/serializable cache (#644)\n\n## 🎯 Summary\n\nReplaces the predicate-based range invalidation APIs on `Cache` with a\nserializable, tag-based invalidation scheme designed to be replayed\nacross\nprocesses over a future cross-node event bus. Adds a `TTag extends\nstring`\ngeneric so callers can constrain tags to a string-literal union.\n\n## 🧩 Changes\n\n- **Breaking:** remove `Cache.obsoleteRange(predicate)` and\n`Cache.removeRange(predicate)`.\n- Add `CacheSettings.getTags?: (value, ...args) => readonly TTag[]`,\nrecomputed on every successful load.\n- Add `Cache.obsoleteByTag(tag)` and `Cache.removeByTag(tag)` with count\nreturn values.\n- `CacheStateManager` now owns a `tagIndex: Map<string, Set<string>>`,\nkept in sync on set / remove / LRU eviction / flushAll.\n- README + cache changelog updated; cross-node-bus internal doc promoted\nfrom spike to PRD v1.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp9gJUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKi8QABn+9/fhwt98rlewxgYD4duR\ng3GEKvlQaICBUoVlC9FZd2MaBCcZ53rxbKVjOif73vtwxAqdSxHbiYdgmYql2sqh\n18/EI9oPgTBhxlbEkysI3pOSb3L0JzTnAX4U/TwAd4fxTnvWw9hFwqxyP/DCZW5b\nHdO2Fatblrj7iVjXu7TFckpyOBFZKDhYL9K7WxBt5TNtZz9nuxT+dcl1d+SKyu8H\n8hEOK+HF01LUiuEE9MBb3qiz4Dzdd9ucrk7KKZ0Eh577NjY/Xy4P1CwWj0TBINC3\nR74ZO5fOfqnrqim5fV5YGWWqM89BQv3oI/2xNWwECcFAjWsoeHNcS0e28u9Y2eb0\nUQf0/5nDVudKQCI5CJJHEBEv/lc32Qaq1ZWKS1pabyZhXHtKO+m3rYSyPg6p2Wa2\ngQwCCGm3OUCfsyEqMoLy3m7evRCtauy3+HTFUoAxIdBg53rUG+pptOHP58xHgidT\nVyOSrTqMPBUOAmnuS7bj0Lh6zYbE/VxO7eLLVfEt1G8J1DL1tkB4Ll5n4gEsDjx0\no70hBkgRCVj5VrbaB2u+12wPMiwKkvocHQ54oFLLYYzSEhFfa6IHGwRdmsYdr6pH\neOpOSlyQKP+RDXvPmqm5qOE0s+OSUbtxTrfkkKrmxzE0K76ly3/qNSXkjn9/E07s\nICXwuik2IyUzpd8sCN31\n=WN5N\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-02T13:55:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6","node_id":"C_kwDOCYZLQNoAKDY3NGMyZjIzODJmN2Q2NDQwYzRkMjYyMDhmM2RkY2VjNTFiOTY0ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4","sha":"1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4"}],"sha":"674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/674c2f2382f7d6440c4d26208f3ddcec51b964d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T08:25:03Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T08:25:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Docs/cursor rule consolidations (#641)\n\n## 📝 Summary\n\nConsolidates Cursor rules + skills, sweeps JSDoc across all packages\n(value-test driven), and lands a few targeted behavior changes.\n\n## ✨ Features\n\n- `@furystack/core`: new `NotFoundError` / `NotSupportedError` public\nexports\n- `@furystack/cache`: new `getKey` option + `setExplicitValue` TTL fix\n- `@furystack/rest-service`: new `UserResolutionCache`\n- `@furystack/filesystem-store`: new `onLoadError` event\n\n## ♻️ Refactors\n\n- Adapter stores (`mongodb`, `sequelize`, `redis`) throw new error\nsubclasses\n- `FileSystemStore`: `hasChanges` → readonly getter, `tick` → private\n\n## 🗑️ Removed\n\n- `@furystack/eslint-plugin`: rule `furystack/no-removed-shade-apis`\n\n## ⬆️ Dependencies\n\n- `vitest` 4.1.4→4.1.5, `vite` 8.0.8→8.0.10, `jsdom` 29.0.2→29.1.0,\n  `ajv` ^8.20.0, `@typescript-eslint/*` ^8.59.0","tree":{"sha":"c453b8efb7228a19776437ca85a4a9bb39cd6c28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/c453b8efb7228a19776437ca85a4a9bb39cd6c28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4","verification":{"payload":"tree c453b8efb7228a19776437ca85a4a9bb39cd6c28\nparent f5cebb26aa11e048f7f112045ce85b0ca5480515\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1777364703 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777364703 +0200\n\nDocs/cursor rule consolidations (#641)\n\n## 📝 Summary\n\nConsolidates Cursor rules + skills, sweeps JSDoc across all packages\n(value-test driven), and lands a few targeted behavior changes.\n\n## ✨ Features\n\n- `@furystack/core`: new `NotFoundError` / `NotSupportedError` public\nexports\n- `@furystack/cache`: new `getKey` option + `setExplicitValue` TTL fix\n- `@furystack/rest-service`: new `UserResolutionCache`\n- `@furystack/filesystem-store`: new `onLoadError` event\n\n## ♻️ Refactors\n\n- Adapter stores (`mongodb`, `sequelize`, `redis`) throw new error\nsubclasses\n- `FileSystemStore`: `hasChanges` → readonly getter, `tick` → private\n\n## 🗑️ Removed\n\n- `@furystack/eslint-plugin`: rule `furystack/no-removed-shade-apis`\n\n## ⬆️ Dependencies\n\n- `vitest` 4.1.4→4.1.5, `vite` 8.0.8→8.0.10, `jsdom` 29.0.2→29.1.0,\n  `ajv` ^8.20.0, `@typescript-eslint/*` ^8.59.0","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8G7fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA014QAIRuJnek5vSN016htolLdv0Z\ntUSBy4MeRKcq9pbYEuELjV542VAs65Dsh8K6cVWjxmb8sfo0T/O8SoHR/+uU2gzv\n+KqD7urE+cvN46tp/B52C+HYWpDDYwXPlhaovhhybznb8P6N4FlGk6bCYciKAy9V\nkA8aYv5FWxwP0sV4WDjKUYhuzlkmqq/bY9C+2E1des8N0HP9/pA2lFPjDeTuHLT5\nx/ZGZPkJhCKnf8a3Usq4gC4g5OTosEwZKpj9Kk9KWgs5MmXmex+3xD5pHtqCLwwT\nQsnsUdH4LwbGQd9PsC02sHUzeugsrVw/LAoqft8l58p6DJp6g1xtKDO2mQ5mldFu\nkDus1VWncYAUHIIuDndGUW34SBPvrADbmZIU7dzYD7iJJvxZqN7kPhMP3pH0kaVa\nmRLJ+lZXIguLd7uBWkSM+00lm83RFwcd1ePWXsuDqxFGk2Uq359PYSeuEA4BytG6\novNRgwcYxoflrFFaPJMFUweTjltg8t5/TD/lAyU/wZIdVtwNQe5xQiSE2PXqkBDW\n77toysClCxyJQtnkuEfnscXd4HWgKpOEqR1hwFhRW9kC4bum1dx9293myUFG4Fub\nmKP2/kBd6ym+h+lMcSmqnkp2SbQ7tbuh0pk5Nd3kHKpv1MDspkKxyZxKk5Y88pWt\nM6f2CalgvtvgA0ktnfG3\n=KT6X\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-28T08:25:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4","node_id":"C_kwDOCYZLQNoAKDFmYTdkYjAwYWY3YWYzOGU2NWM0NmQ5ZmY5MDFiODUzMGQyMTM1YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/f5cebb26aa11e048f7f112045ce85b0ca5480515","sha":"f5cebb26aa11e048f7f112045ce85b0ca5480515","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/f5cebb26aa11e048f7f112045ce85b0ca5480515"}],"sha":"1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/1fa7db00af7af38e65c46d9ff901b8530d2135a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/f5cebb26aa11e048f7f112045ce85b0ca5480515/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:21:45Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:21:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: User identity cache improvements (#640)\n\n## ✨ Summary\n\nAdds a singleton short-TTL `UserResolutionCache` to\n`@furystack/rest-service`, extends `@furystack/cache` to support\nnon-stringifiable args via a `getKey` option, and introduces an optional\n`getCacheKey` hook on `AuthenticationProvider`. Replaces the previous\nper-request `WeakMap<headers, Promise<User>>` inside `HttpUserContext`\nwith a process-wide TTL cache (default 30 s, 10 000-entry LRU) keyed by\n`cookie:${sessionId}`. Bounds cross-instance staleness for session/role\nchanges and cuts auth-store load on chatty clients.\n\nAlso includes a parent spike doc\n(`docs/internal/cross-node-bus-spike.md`) outlining a generalized\ncross-node event bus with `ChangeBroadcaster` (entity-sync) and\n`IdentityEventBroadcaster` (rest-service) as planned consumers.\n\n## 🛠️ Changes\n\n- **`@furystack/cache`** — new `getKey` option on `CacheSettings`\n(overrides `JSON.stringify(args)` for cache indexing), fix for\n`setExplicitValue` not arming TTL timers when value is `loaded`, fix for\n`obsoleteRange`/`removeRange` predicate args under custom `getKey`.\n- **`@furystack/rest-service`** — new `UserResolutionCache` singleton\ntoken, new `userCacheTtlMs` / `userCacheCapacity` on\n`HttpAuthenticationSettings`, new optional `getCacheKey?(request)` on\n`AuthenticationProvider`, cookie-auth provider keys by\n`cookie:${sessionId}`, basic-auth opts out (documented), `cookieLogout`\ninvalidates the local cache entry.\n- **`@furystack/auth-jwt`** — doc-only: explains why JWT intentionally\ndoes not implement `getCacheKey`.\n- **`@furystack/websocket-api`** — integration test now invalidates the\ncache after out-of-band role mutation; documents the recommended\npattern.\n- **`docs/internal/cross-node-bus-spike.md`** — design spike for the\nfuture shared cross-node bus.\n\n## 📦 Versioning\n\n- `@furystack/cache`: minor\n- `@furystack/rest-service`: minor\n- `@furystack/auth-jwt`, `@furystack/websocket-api`: patch\n- `@furystack/auth-google`, `@furystack/entity-sync-service`,\n`@furystack/shades-common-components`, `@furystack/shades-showcase-app`,\n`furystack`: patch (dep alignment)\n\n## 🧪 Tests\n\n- 1943/1943 pass.\n- New `user-resolution-cache.spec.ts` (resolve / invalidate /\ninvalidateAll / TTL=0 disable / error path / `resolveUserCacheKey`).\n- New cache `getKey option` describe block (3 cases including\n`setExplicitValue` timer arming).\n- `http-user-context.spec.ts` rewritten for cookie-keyed cache:\nper-session caching, distinct-session isolation, anonymous bypass,\n`cookieLogout` invalidation.\n- `websocket-integration.spec.ts` documents\n`UserResolutionCache.invalidateAll()` after out-of-band role mutation.","tree":{"sha":"e5d70e1c7efe845c8d73862af66cbd53f6ec55a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/e5d70e1c7efe845c8d73862af66cbd53f6ec55a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/f5cebb26aa11e048f7f112045ce85b0ca5480515","verification":{"payload":"tree e5d70e1c7efe845c8d73862af66cbd53f6ec55a9\nparent d6e7c43adc1791eed7938ce82c7eaa6a1f5d22c9\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1777202505 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777202505 +0200\n\nfeat: User identity cache improvements (#640)\n\n## ✨ Summary\n\nAdds a singleton short-TTL `UserResolutionCache` to\n`@furystack/rest-service`, extends `@furystack/cache` to support\nnon-stringifiable args via a `getKey` option, and introduces an optional\n`getCacheKey` hook on `AuthenticationProvider`. Replaces the previous\nper-request `WeakMap<headers, Promise<User>>` inside `HttpUserContext`\nwith a process-wide TTL cache (default 30 s, 10 000-entry LRU) keyed by\n`cookie:${sessionId}`. Bounds cross-instance staleness for session/role\nchanges and cuts auth-store load on chatty clients.\n\nAlso includes a parent spike doc\n(`docs/internal/cross-node-bus-spike.md`) outlining a generalized\ncross-node event bus with `ChangeBroadcaster` (entity-sync) and\n`IdentityEventBroadcaster` (rest-service) as planned consumers.\n\n## 🛠️ Changes\n\n- **`@furystack/cache`** — new `getKey` option on `CacheSettings`\n(overrides `JSON.stringify(args)` for cache indexing), fix for\n`setExplicitValue` not arming TTL timers when value is `loaded`, fix for\n`obsoleteRange`/`removeRange` predicate args under custom `getKey`.\n- **`@furystack/rest-service`** — new `UserResolutionCache` singleton\ntoken, new `userCacheTtlMs` / `userCacheCapacity` on\n`HttpAuthenticationSettings`, new optional `getCacheKey?(request)` on\n`AuthenticationProvider`, cookie-auth provider keys by\n`cookie:${sessionId}`, basic-auth opts out (documented), `cookieLogout`\ninvalidates the local cache entry.\n- **`@furystack/auth-jwt`** — doc-only: explains why JWT intentionally\ndoes not implement `getCacheKey`.\n- **`@furystack/websocket-api`** — integration test now invalidates the\ncache after out-of-band role mutation; documents the recommended\npattern.\n- **`docs/internal/cross-node-bus-spike.md`** — design spike for the\nfuture shared cross-node bus.\n\n## 📦 Versioning\n\n- `@furystack/cache`: minor\n- `@furystack/rest-service`: minor\n- `@furystack/auth-jwt`, `@furystack/websocket-api`: patch\n- `@furystack/auth-google`, `@furystack/entity-sync-service`,\n`@furystack/shades-common-components`, `@furystack/shades-showcase-app`,\n`furystack`: patch (dep alignment)\n\n## 🧪 Tests\n\n- 1943/1943 pass.\n- New `user-resolution-cache.spec.ts` (resolve / invalidate /\ninvalidateAll / TTL=0 disable / error path / `resolveUserCacheKey`).\n- New cache `getKey option` describe block (3 cases including\n`setExplicitValue` timer arming).\n- `http-user-context.spec.ts` rewritten for cookie-keyed cache:\nper-session caching, distinct-session isolation, anonymous bypass,\n`cookieLogout` invalidation.\n- `websocket-integration.spec.ts` documents\n`UserResolutionCache.invalidateAll()` after out-of-band role mutation.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp7fVJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAniAQADOulrnHdyrD6walFAe2kkw+\ntG+irDz6c6U4Be+uVw9O/0JMbj0wRYE8Qp7QhsYW4l0KXMjwYH7QH19SSsNuvy6A\nSBpwPRG4Tk/mWg60YtD+dQbzzB+VUh1gbGOt74Iv2zF5VsAMLsP2MREBQmwPgkfR\nsEKqJjwfB8LXyVAkYF0MYaWDH+NU5SEHWuMoew7ilMNtp8H4KHE1NeIO1vt+k1rZ\n/UPyPjcwSEMIaqBxxmTZfhsIU9YB+LmgNThL0gXzinOUk9KriIwUwG7ZM32yqbdS\nlcQGu/Uuw2kvtqDjK+PHTa8K9DltDL1+3X5JFKBTMUVl5Hu76FDeIbY26x4WYx77\nfmZSmvBnSb76bqDbbqH70DUNbvLMHsP/gsg78WPEzTEJFa1ohL4ElHh14nhsqonK\nVxtadATLfdczBx+GXbA8r+oyOEgj22tcCnCvuPyg2lwf5e1mAlTpGB/14R2llcig\n7NqcVwXlGEPbbQcl7dVv5dnBvkCOR2VOee+OQZemDRLyT03RxMsEDxN8EFkDkaxY\noaJ2zhG/17zEV24uEXY3rI+jgcZtFTPHKj32fQH6ms4ggFMo8o8A+C2gEF5+FYgx\nsOZGRmXxaG7+99HsjGO6zdYNI/L4J0yJ15aIpO7i8Qz0YdpsdBX7XhZX+EFmSxS7\n9CQ4G11KO7bTH8XDLbbd\n=oNog\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-26T11:21:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","