arents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/a3df73e3861288daf3052fac73648ac9833b5191","sha":"a3df73e3861288daf3052fac73648ac9833b5191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/a3df73e3861288daf3052fac73648ac9833b5191"}],"sha":"d6e7c43adc1791eed7938ce82c7eaa6a1f5d22c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/d6e7c43adc1791eed7938ce82c7eaa6a1f5d22c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/a3df73e3861288daf3052fac73648ac9833b5191/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T08:08:56Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T08:08:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(entity-sync-service): Fix current user scope (#639)\n\n## 🐛 Fix\n\n`SubscriptionManager` retained the per-message websocket injector handed\nin by `SyncSubscribeAction` as the long-lived `clientInjector` for the\nsubscription. With `@furystack/websocket-api@14`, that scope is disposed\nas soon as the action returns, so every subsequent collection\nre-evaluation called `findEntities` / `countEntities` on a disposed\nscope. On any DataSet that exposes `authorizeGet` (or anything else that\nresolves `IdentityContext`), this turned legitimate change notifications\ninto `subscription-error` messages — visible to clients as\nsnapshot/sidebar/dashboard lists that never refreshed after writes.\n\n## 🛠️ Solution\n\n`SubscriptionManager.subscribeEntity` / `subscribeCollection` now\nsnapshot the caller''s identity once at subscribe time\n(`IdentityContext.getCurrentUser()`) and spawn a fresh long-lived child\nof the root injector with that identity bound on a snapshot\n`IdentityContext`:\n\n- `isAuthenticated` resolves to `true` for the captured user.\n- `isAuthorized(...roles)` checks the captured `user.roles`.\n- `getCurrentUser()` returns the captured user.\n\nThat captured scope is used for the initial query and every\nre-evaluation, then disposed on `unsubscribe`, socket close,\n`subscription-error` paths, and manager dispose. Anonymous callers fall\nback to the default unauthenticated `IdentityContext`, so `authorizeGet`\nhooks still see an unauthenticated identity instead of a system-elevated\none.\n\n## 🧪 Tests\n\n5 new regression tests under `per-message scope disposal regression` in\n`subscription-manager.spec.ts`:\n\n- Collection notifications keep flowing after the caller scope is\ndisposed.\n- `authorizeGet` re-runs against the captured identity, not the disposed\ncaller scope.\n- Unauthenticated callers receive `subscription-error` from\n`authorizeGet` (no identity leakage).\n- Captured `user.roles` are preserved across re-evaluations.\n- Entity-update notifications still flow when the caller scope is\ndisposed.\n\n## 📦 Versioning\n\n- `@furystack/entity-sync-service`: patch\n- `furystack`: patch","tree":{"sha":"0e28063119cbc84254c46b1a94ba6f9d1a73907e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/0e28063119cbc84254c46b1a94ba6f9d1a73907e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/a3df73e3861288daf3052fac73648ac9833b5191","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e28063119cbc84254c46b1a94ba6f9d1a73907e\nparent caab5f171cbaf9c687d3cf24a7bad172424628ac\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1777190936 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777190936 +0000\n\nfix(entity-sync-service): Fix current user scope (#639)\n\n## 🐛 Fix\n\n`SubscriptionManager` retained the per-message websocket injector handed\nin by `SyncSubscribeAction` as the long-lived `clientInjector` for the\nsubscription. With `@furystack/websocket-api@14`, that scope is disposed\nas soon as the action returns, so every subsequent collection\nre-evaluation called `findEntities` / `countEntities` on a disposed\nscope. On any DataSet that exposes `authorizeGet` (or anything else that\nresolves `IdentityContext`), this turned legitimate change notifications\ninto `subscription-error` messages — visible to clients as\nsnapshot/sidebar/dashboard lists that never refreshed after writes.\n\n## 🛠️ Solution\n\n`SubscriptionManager.subscribeEntity` / `subscribeCollection` now\nsnapshot the caller''s identity once at subscribe time\n(`IdentityContext.getCurrentUser()`) and spawn a fresh long-lived child\nof the root injector with that identity bound on a snapshot\n`IdentityContext`:\n\n- `isAuthenticated` resolves to `true` for the captured user.\n- `isAuthorized(...roles)` checks the captured `user.roles`.\n- `getCurrentUser()` returns the captured user.\n\nThat captured scope is used for the initial query and every\nre-evaluation, then disposed on `unsubscribe`, socket close,\n`subscription-error` paths, and manager dispose. Anonymous callers fall\nback to the default unauthenticated `IdentityContext`, so `authorizeGet`\nhooks still see an unauthenticated identity instead of a system-elevated\none.\n\n## 🧪 Tests\n\n5 new regression tests under `per-message scope disposal regression` in\n`subscription-manager.spec.ts`:\n\n- Collection notifications keep flowing after the caller scope is\ndisposed.\n- `authorizeGet` re-runs against the captured identity, not the disposed\ncaller scope.\n- Unauthenticated callers receive `subscription-error` from\n`authorizeGet` (no identity leakage).\n- Captured `user.roles` are preserved across re-evaluations.\n- Entity-update notifications still flow when the caller scope is\ndisposed.\n\n## 📦 Versioning\n\n- `@furystack/entity-sync-service`: patch\n- `furystack`: patch","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp7cgYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASwEQAFwm8o15C350+qzz7pJCItJ3\nFLlFe/S5anUfrq4PgwwNKuANg9wmRTi8ien/J5HxMIMPletlLDAw9RZ7lvfPXs6O\n7zrrgZU/RcK3gKasm/oT0oi4eahvV8U3Aglvr7rZZrQfV0S2ovlcqkLTSe0JGMVc\nnPQ08uM2fq447enNVZuRZPP5VZ1T+XWIw5BrFPqQDGto24M3KNjQ4C2uQPtLujjK\nG5Vy4EJngMv/QHAx5gSq5amsTgi1IOfA8rDghW8kiQFZVF1jW5wYbhna6mxx+pB0\ny5IwQvqhE7RKbitzbOa2rUhsoBbhNBlRvPmAZTvuku+VjQ+/9fxnPirogAoQWrfw\nfgY+qI63fPxT5BhZdRUm89IWGsRHgF+lrnhZQBWBuUThssg8UeXBSSnoVF92bBhd\nGfdInBaA38uVmy6ffXA0lJtD1nZxYd4RMuiIEDpZufW+x/WXf2kbTv44j2xanIMn\nAGm6Gy4ckz3Qyh1iUXB9AKaQnjIj8bHXYMB63mbatgruLy524nCOIwPhMBiBecc3\nZHNcMRJ1tRwGpGGNqvcpgWRPaO0qLroLT9gnTkVnnP1tc0E+KDN6LpGO4B7ocpd+\nGwiAHt+SgqddYZhc/OlC51oiTrLbqhRWKdGU0M/6fcoyfDNL76YHIGBikSxoPJPY\nQjVaP/mQa1fZXhj6Eie2\n=R/Kq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-26T08:08:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https:/