w_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/1a099247ccde24f45df70c4ff30de86aa78e7ab1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T11:19:33Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T11:19:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/minor common component improvements (#633)\n\n## ✨ Minor common component improvements\n\nUnifies component sizing with a shared `ComponentSize` type, adds `size`\nprop support to form controls, introduces a reusable `RouteBreadcrumb`\ncomponent extracted from the showcase app, and adds horizontal\norientation to `Timeline`.\n\n### 🔧 Changes\n\n- **`ComponentSize` type** — shared `''small'' | ''medium'' | ''large''` type\nreplacing inline unions across all sizing components\n- **Form control sizing** — Input, Select, InputNumber, TextArea,\nCheckbox, and Radio now accept a `size` prop (defaulting to `''medium''`)\n- **Extended sizes** — Chip, Switch, and SegmentedControl gain `''large''`\nas a new option\n- **`RouteBreadcrumb`** — reusable component that derives breadcrumb\nitems from `RouteMatchService`, replacing hand-rolled logic in the\nshowcase\n- **Horizontal `Timeline`** — new `orientation` prop (`''vertical'' |\n''horizontal''`) with full support for all layout modes and pending\nindicators\n\n### 🧪 Tests\n\n- Size prop tests for all affected form controls\n- `RouteBreadcrumb` tests covering route resolution, async titles,\n`skipRootPath`, `homeItem`, and path accumulation","tree":{"sha":"39d210cce3161975a680b5fdbe65c3f240751d13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/39d210cce3161975a680b5fdbe65c3f240751d13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/1a099247ccde24f45df70c4ff30de86aa78e7ab1","verification":{"payload":"tree 39d210cce3161975a680b5fdbe65c3f240751d13\nparent 6997753f57ad99b82ffb60feae589502eca5f254\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1774869573 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774869573 +0200\n\nFeat/minor common component improvements (#633)\n\n## ✨ Minor common component improvements\n\nUnifies component sizing with a shared `ComponentSize` type, adds `size`\nprop support to form controls, introduces a reusable `RouteBreadcrumb`\ncomponent extracted from the showcase app, and adds horizontal\norientation to `Timeline`.\n\n### 🔧 Changes\n\n- **`ComponentSize` type** — shared `''small'' | ''medium'' | ''large''` type\nreplacing inline unions across all sizing components\n- **Form control sizing** — Input, Select, InputNumber, TextArea,\nCheckbox, and Radio now accept a `size` prop (defaulting to `''medium''`)\n- **Extended sizes** — Chip, Switch, and SegmentedControl gain `''large''`\nas a new option\n- **`RouteBreadcrumb`** — reusable component that derives breadcrumb\nitems from `RouteMatchService`, replacing hand-rolled logic in the\nshowcase\n- **Horizontal `Timeline`** — new `orientation` prop (`''vertical'' |\n''horizontal''`) with full support for all layout modes and pending\nindicators\n\n### 🧪 Tests\n\n- Size prop tests for all affected form controls\n- `RouteBreadcrumb` tests covering route resolution, async titles,\n`skipRootPath`, `homeItem`, and path accumulation","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpylxFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATfwQAAju2PsmTYkAlOhWmBoyfZxx\nFn3o9QI3twgbrDecoZq4PItXx5LC+ukkl0x02HXbUKd3y7+eYWmLO+Bv26gGQkwu\n3UEJUBribLfzVVeb+U/ZlxdeqG/w2frm4Gl5DOD/iql8qp+h6X9bkHzyv7MTMK6J\nzwtHhsL3EV4m+UXz1t1DCbjcckmLycVsd0z2YroRh+SSO47qsKJBWPE5/Gsqc8/l\nqFBeoAe8dCuBnOLDQH5YJI4QHhg6AO4qwV7Zg45uw8K61RmAfe13/iw3AydfhH7+\nxFoae40lVj5qe0ud5rNWSdEl1eQ2eehLNQ9H6gOqG3mxDI94qw5d9vcf5PxFcoCu\nuVcxfVSyHFOWxjWPQVvirAV4gYrcTPUs1eTr724yhBUy3zzevWgClRtWtdQxX9Ex\nOLAvS3RqBzdbCRfMplxZmNXBC/EVfYSjlv6aHa1Gx0Ra1LEAWP2373kNmoc/sxGH\n/sOU3MIiw90miRGB7ygfnQq5BPiq++SZwNEoVL3SpcXtdPa1qpX3y3/UxBxW1XX1\nFks6LUuU469xLTXr1OpqKSvzSc+76tTxa6kZboG