ub.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/f926b442e3c5906654cf2c1917eb3429d94ff2e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T20:26:51Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T20:26:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(shades): Props empty transition (#632)\n\n## 🐛 Fix: Shade props empty transition\n\nNormalizes `VNode.props` to always be `{}` instead of `null` when no\nprops are provided. This prevents errors during component patching when\nprops transition from having values to none (e.g. a Shade component\ngoing from `{ elevation: 2 }` to no props).\n\n## 🔍 What changed\n\n- `VNode.props` type narrowed from `Record<string, unknown> | null` to\n`Record<string, unknown>`\n- `createVNode`, `flattenVChildren`, `toVChildArray`, and DOM-shim\nhelpers updated to use `{}` instead of `null`\n- Simplified null-guard branches in\n`setAttribute`/`removeAttribute`/`getAttribute`/`hasAttribute` shims\n\n## 🧪 Tests\n\n- Added test for `null` props normalization in `createVNode`\n- Added regression test for Shade component receiving `{}` (not `null`)\nwhen props transition to none","tree":{"sha":"c817ccb9a0b3d8280fd58b293193c01dbacb9ac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/c817ccb9a0b3d8280fd58b293193c01dbacb9ac1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/f926b442e3c5906654cf2c1917eb3429d94ff2e2","verification":{"payload":"tree c817ccb9a0b3d8280fd58b293193c01dbacb9ac1\nparent c14cbb7db48eea76e8b09c14c5ddd4a9388565c9\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1774643211 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774643211 +0000\n\nfix(shades): Props empty transition (#632)\n\n## 🐛 Fix: Shade props empty transition\n\nNormalizes `VNode.props` to always be `{}` instead of `null` when no\nprops are provided. This prevents errors during component patching when\nprops transition from having values to none (e.g. a Shade component\ngoing from `{ elevation: 2 }` to no props).\n\n## 🔍 What changed\n\n- `VNode.props` type narrowed from `Record<string, unknown> | null` to\n`Record<string, unknown>`\n- `createVNode`, `flattenVChildren`, `toVChildArray`, and DOM-shim\nhelpers updated to use `{}` instead of `null`\n- Simplified null-guard branches in\n`setAttribute`/`removeAttribute`/`getAttribute`/`hasAttribute` shims\n\n## 🧪 Tests\n\n- Added test for `null` props normalization in `createVNode`\n- Added regression test for Shade component receiving `{}` (not `null`)\nwhen props transition to none","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpxugLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl1gQAKAUg92j80u90MpNjk6jzCcY\nbIcg/luH9/981b9nJc6iZfn4S6uHwjZ6NdTuK+Fuw8GBO9zTO2M0KUsjMGdIJRvU\nmY7j9Jz0ZbMqv0ZwJv8E8GLx6RnnZnNekZcahSnFhjCRtD/xUcPofUuf18L6+Mb5\n9gfArKgnbcd2+NzChJlwiDLFKxE2mO4b2QxS0sVg64kiHo/8JhlS2YC7ZkzC1HHl\nNkVgc+rOW0d5pTroKCzBu0o15qh3m+jG8cCcXSAVHueQTLx+afhxTMKyYfX9tIVs\nfox9eujSQt9R4TrloHzkVCHjxWQKpauIghadwbaSzAoRrCy/PvPxEeWtcGaeriZJ\n4YOFqtCcmkLsqy++3B7UZ3AeBaFfuktDcRLUCHbopuYh/s1GlimcQOzcaxBy5D2+\nLNbcV0okjsr5sB2Ya59WJEB4renaMP7dxhK/Z1Tdrg3ftmw0qGnWIh0/QOlrvcJc\nfC5N5Q0Q+bJ7FlX1rRaTWdQm/LLP+ifQEmv6uPufTU9Qg1PEchEk3f8mTSW8vA5p\nrM9FDub8JuFh1Cl64grAfMndr7mWINQVFSKVc734lU35NeZHImT22fRaaSOOqOq5\nBwmpB7FOc5rEKmry1QFCCK9o1rPcamvwBTTWs0zzJblQHFBQUXVWuFRs8H5CCfng\nFOoSrM5ElkqqjbSWY2wd\n=DiCa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-27T20:26:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo