{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/600c285708f83fb0033bf0d71dff65e8076372cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T08:03:18Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T08:03:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/nipple upgrade (#629)\n\n## 🚀 Summary\n\nThis PR upgrades `@furystack/shades-nipple` to the latest `nipplejs` and\naligns the component callback API with the current runtime event model.\n\n### Key changes\n- Upgrade dependency: `nipplejs` from `^0.10.2` to `^1.0.1`\n- Update `NippleComponent` callback signatures:\n- `onStart`, `onMove`, `onDir`, `onEnd` now receive a single `event`\nobject\n  - Joystick payload is accessed via `event.data`\n- Update showcase integration page to use the new callback shape\n- Update README examples and props documentation for the new API\n- Add focused integration test in\n`packages/shades-nipple/src/nipple.spec.tsx`:\n  - Mocks `nipplejs.create()`\n  - Verifies manager event registration\n- Simulates runtime `move` event and asserts `event.data` is forwarded\ncorrectly\n\n## 💥 Breaking Change\n\n`NippleComponent` callback handlers no longer receive positional `(evt,\ndata)` arguments.\n\n### Before\n```tsx\n<NippleComponent\n  onMove={(_evt, data) => {\n    console.log(data.force)\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n### After\n```tsx\n<NippleComponent\n  onMove={(event) => {\n    console.log(event.data.force)\n  }}\n/>\n```","tree":{"sha":"b7c5202d3aae918525390f9dd1267ccdf066dcbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/b7c5202d3aae918525390f9dd1267ccdf066dcbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/600c285708f83fb0033bf0d71dff65e8076372cd","verification":{"payload":"tree b7c5202d3aae918525390f9dd1267ccdf066dcbd\nparent 728ffa44b5960128454a344d16736e0a193d2826\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1774598598 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774598598 +0000\n\nFeat/nipple upgrade (#629)\n\n## 🚀 Summary\n\nThis PR upgrades `@furystack/shades-nipple` to the latest `nipplejs` and\naligns the component callback API with the current runtime event model.\n\n### Key changes\n- Upgrade dependency: `nipplejs` from `^0.10.2` to `^1.0.1`\n- Update `NippleComponent` callback signatures:\n- `onStart`, `onMove`, `onDir`, `onEnd` now receive a single `event`\nobject\n  - Joystick payload is accessed via `event.data`\n- Update showcase integration page to use the new callback shape\n- Update README examples and props documentation for the new API\n- Add focused integration test in\n`packages/shades-nipple/src/nipple.spec.tsx`:\n  - Mocks `nipplejs.create()`\n  - Verifies manager event registration\n- Simulates runtime `move` event and asserts `event.data` is forwarded\ncorrectly\n\n## 💥 Breaking Change\n\n`NippleComponent` callback handlers no longer receive positional `(evt,\ndata)` arguments.\n\n### Before\n```tsx\n<NippleComponent\n  onMove={(_evt, data) => {\n    console.log(data.force)\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n### After\n```tsx\n<NippleComponent\n  onMove={(event) => {\n    console.log(event.data.force)\n  }}\n/>\n```","r