gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/bcd3f0da39c3e5dbfd89135c6c0542795d4f0d51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T16:03:59Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T16:03:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Explicit identity context (#622)\n\n## 🔧 Fix: Explicit IdentityContext Lifetime\n\nChanges `IdentityContext` from `@Injectable({ lifetime: ''scoped'' })` to\n`@Injectable({ lifetime: ''explicit'' })` so that child injectors inherit\nthe identity context from their parent instead of silently creating a\nbroken default instance.\n\n### 💥 Breaking Change\n\n`injector.getInstance(IdentityContext)` now throws if no instance was\npreviously set via `setExplicitInstance`. All standard FuryStack setups\n(`useHttpAuthentication`, `useJwtAuthentication`,\n`useSystemIdentityContext`) already do this and are unaffected.","tree":{"sha":"68e39abf4239a0eba10bf223f83f11aa4bb01f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/68e39abf4239a0eba10bf223f83f11aa4bb01f44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/bcd3f0da39c3e5dbfd89135c6c0542795d4f0d51","verification":{"payload":"tree 68e39abf4239a0eba10bf223f83f11aa4bb01f44\nparent 0eef437140c3d7c04b5ebd3f97bba9642197269c\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772985839 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772985839 +0000\n\nfeat: Explicit identity context (#622)\n\n## 🔧 Fix: Explicit IdentityContext Lifetime\n\nChanges `IdentityContext` from `@Injectable({ lifetime: ''scoped'' })` to\n`@Injectable({ lifetime: ''explicit'' })` so that child injectors inherit\nthe identity context from their parent instead of silently creating a\nbroken default instance.\n\n### 💥 Breaking Change\n\n`injector.getInstance(IdentityContext)` now throws if no instance was\npreviously set via `setExplicitInstance`. All standard FuryStack setups\n(`useHttpAuthentication`, `useJwtAuthentication`,\n`useSystemIdentityContext`) already do this and are unaffected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJprZ3vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxoAQADtCsDIis6Gw8OB8ZAs2lYRU\nI65cPDfRX8K3/AOv6r9uNd/5Nft0vFIikajIxt1OUGg72mwg3eRtUsa+W1ERaeQ8\nbeFhBwUAVUQkr0EqqClr7kc8PG7S2AyRCDeHLUGpnM+/BsgkrCn6Bj/M39Ex5udz\noaDdoJ+PZwPK4nfVTmvNO5zEJUOv8DI2beYoiKV5pvq6gOLkQyKnljmsa9kv+7zZ\n0uDYV1cFww6ubQju6lFdGy6OFQY6/3B8uO1hBjBs3oAukosOnEXan9Ce4frX/hUk\nSqubpt0KUeiLHWHiLXXsvW+OjZ9VNhTdfIycVU/S1sZmkaDf6PDyOf0t96MBUx64\n1eKqOXST2qD+7ERIwbzVUcA+5ULPoSQGRTbHs5/ubBSgsyIqHlBrCY6TW0ADV8Yq\nl2RxRUkFe4pvBI5sCIeyzmiHEiKYJztzpcZxhCybuQ1y9wdak9nDoziXKvLIbndF\nnlKZerKnHnDwTJdM9AASe3Zzz65a+U5O9jdaupLPZKEDiLYB+c3dsUXNWwccPt8L\nTMeUxPMDTNekDaiDuWCNRwCxo049J/8kTgy+ASwGZZz/ZVYdMXUoKuCu2VB8PHqr\nVJU1T0J9q55T8a6ByxKHJHM4nZVvf5Il8R8tViims5FmLzEQHYPM4ZWttsFZbPff\nTu3cwBuzPvnPsjqHOqtr\n=1P0r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-08T16:03:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false