16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/9fa44b5d9a19e861a09544d2f204f6603dafb4c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T10:22:08Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T10:22:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/furystack eslint (#617)\n\n## ✨ Summary\n\nIntroduces `@furystack/eslint-plugin`, a new ESLint plugin with 17\ncustom rules enforcing FuryStack patterns for dependency injection,\nobservable lifecycle management, Shades component conventions, and REST\nAPI actions. The plugin ships with 4 preset configurations\n(`recommended`, `recommendedStrict`, `shades`, `shadesStrict`) and is\nintegrated into the monorepo''s ESLint setup.\n\nAlso fixes disposal memory leaks in `LocationService` and\n`ScreenService`, adds `LocationService.replace()` for SPA redirects, and\napplies lint fixes across the codebase.\n\n## 📦 Packages Changed\n\n- **`@furystack/eslint-plugin`** (new, `1.0.0`) — 17 rules, 4 configs,\nfull test suite\n- **`@furystack/shades`** (`patch`) — Disposal fixes in\n`LocationService` and `ScreenService`, new `replace()` method\n- **`@furystack/shades-common-components`** (`patch`) — Lint fix for\nobservable subscription\n- **`@furystack/shades-showcase-app`** (`patch`) — Adopt\n`NestedRouteLink` and `LocationService.navigate()`/`.replace()`\n- Various packages — Transitive dependency bumps","tree":{"sha":"db9690134a8c640078ac439ea6bfb0a521c62204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/db9690134a8c640078ac439ea6bfb0a521c62204"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/9fa44b5d9a19e861a09544d2f204f6603dafb4c0","verification":{"payload":"tree db9690134a8c640078ac439ea6bfb0a521c62204\nparent b217300175db8b3b8eede0717e91148979d63454\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772792528 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772792528 +0100\n\nFeat/furystack eslint (#617)\n\n## ✨ Summary\n\nIntroduces `@furystack/eslint-plugin`, a new ESLint plugin with 17\ncustom rules enforcing FuryStack patterns for dependency injection,\nobservable lifecycle management, Shades component conventions, and REST\nAPI actions. The plugin ships with 4 preset configurations\n(`recommended`, `recommendedStrict`, `shades`, `shadesStrict`) and is\nintegrated into the monorepo''s ESLint setup.\n\nAlso fixes disposal memory leaks in `LocationService` and\n`ScreenService`, adds `LocationService.replace()` for SPA redirects, and\napplies lint fixes across the codebase.\n\n## 📦 Packages Changed\n\n- **`@furystack/eslint-plugin`** (new, `1.0.0`) — 17 rules, 4 configs,\nfull test suite\n- **`@furystack/shades`** (`patch`) — Disposal fixes in\n`LocationService` and `ScreenService`, new `replace()` method\n- **`@furystack/shades-common-components`** (`patch`) — Lint fix for\nobservable subscription\n- **`@furystack/shades-showcase-app`** (`patch`) — Adopt\n`NestedRouteLink` and `LocationService.navigate()`/`.replace()`\n- Various packages — Transitive dependency bumps","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqqrQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtR8QAG9tUQQLQQpk5BkQc/ebmzeO\n4P36dzzL4jd8rdYHf9dO6yQz4O1Y001yuZp/wwLoz+iYc0wasRaOqr6Vkrj7fQDd\n7m0GVsj2v3dQPhkacUYfTmfQRgYapD9vIz/wtu5DyKSF+sYXC2qxtLj6N/t+T3h3\nu72v1uOrHdASTleh/kIXzuT/3gVTn/uhCLJtM1eCSryto2XFZGN+ZfjFUZkZlA+u\nYfLrY39FNDe9f5rWfQycUaMCL2kRza1latneXY4E5cRbM25dEDooBkx