0875cf3fa8dda5e8865910b12601e63d1c072","node_id":"C_kwDOCYZLQNoAKDU5MTA4NzVjZjNmYThkZGE1ZTg4NjU5MTBiMTI2MDFlNjNkMWMwNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/furystack/commit/f16962a63394282af93dac5994d9cf9e9db796d6","sha":"f16962a63394282af93dac5994d9cf9e9db796d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/f16962a63394282af93dac5994d9cf9e9db796d6"}],"sha":"5910875cf3fa8dda5e8865910b12601e63d1c072","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/5910875cf3fa8dda5e8865910b12601e63d1c072"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/f16962a63394282af93dac5994d9cf9e9db796d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T14:26:47Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T14:26:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix/rendering race conditions (#613)\n\n## 🐛 Fix ghost rendering race conditions in Shades\n\nFixes a bug where `updateComponent()` and `updateComponentSync()` could\ntrigger\nre-renders on components that had already been disconnected from the\nDOM. This\noccurred when observable subscriptions fired during async disposal in\n`disconnectedCallback`, causing stale render passes that could re-add\ncleared state\n(e.g., Drawer re-adding its position to `LayoutService` after removal).\n\n### 🔧 Changes\n\n- Added a `_disconnected` flag to the Shade custom element class, set in\n  `disconnectedCallback` and cleared in `connectedCallback`\n- Both `updateComponent()` and `updateComponentSync()` now return early\nwhen\n  the component is disconnected\n- Added unit tests for the core Shade guard behavior\n- Added a Drawer regression test verifying ghost renders don''t re-add\ndrawer state","tree":{"sha":"3863227ead2fd6163d5395a0a6cd1afada030f0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/3863227ead2fd6163d5395a0a6cd1afada030f0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/f16962a63394282af93dac5994d9cf9e9db796d6","verification":{"payload":"tree 3863227ead2fd6163d5395a0a6cd1afada030f0c\nparent f67706a1126a101003008da41a773e8f385f828e\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772634407 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772634407 +0000\n\nFix/rendering race conditions (#613)\n\n## 🐛 Fix ghost rendering race conditions in Shades\n\nFixes a bug where `updateComponent()` and `updateComponentSync()` could\ntrigger\nre-renders on components that had already been disconnected from the\nDOM. This\noccurred when observable subscriptions fired during async disposal in\n`disconnectedCallback`, causing stale render passes that could re-add\ncleared state\n(e.g., Drawer re-adding its position to `LayoutService` after removal).\n\n### 🔧 Changes\n\n- Added a `_disconnected` flag to the Shade custom element class, set in\n  `disconnectedCallback` and cleared in `connectedCallback`\n- Both `updateComponent()` and `updateComponentSync()` now return early\nwhen\n  the component is disconnected\n- Added unit tests for the core Shade guard behavior\n- Added a Drawer regression test verifying ghost renders don''t re-add\ndrawer state","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqEEnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXgIQAFda0LZT1Xtrxh5FVyBiMITc\nNdej9A+jm4GYXRzHsNWoTpneor8ZyBbYtntogjqFHGqyVXgCB7LMLyu2rXTPhI3T\nWLXUowf5F4vWBjcbILPk1MyiHenaOkqRNhaFz1jQfwlXnuMp6WGVgTCEtSClkz2C\n9bFcIqiDfrXlfWmNclax1jkD3f3nqnjp6C4O+aUw6nerLPdnm+EB4cyVL01bZOHw\n6atM8yYkwifwKPZwzik4bqJqT5Y30BKoQof9yMnDiMWV/zfd9vi1wL8gpk92OIqo\nZCAkWZryJOUsvzpWOfL3wFr32khcHiFVo0WYpFRXStoQvMs9dJMWraz+MgE9fb+9\n7aq50/hu+nflyeipdwO4/AoG/7z71Cp2rIMJPCgrp1L1jzB2VN0nNMqHoDeaNkq9\n1i6K9vR7RUZKFyPxuQyikkH27L3pHEQBrtn+hYD2Q8Iy9108iAeyC8G2f46L2iTz\nLT2iQi0tlWn9iaURzjVd6G3xkFb88rKqyLYmnd7THXWnvvvGAGlbaZ60cUMotgL7\nwPAnMaFbn4se1Srfz9kD3sXQlTG4QIOOr7WzkpnYy43nH2etGerSe4zjU/rUZtoy\nplx4HvdUG4PPw/hpsRKDb1Uw7M2+XjGcSpLqhTutiSDK/aeyFFJNIQ2Lja4cAU2n\n1o4okA/c9083TKWK22pP\n=el5Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-04T14:26:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"