s","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/commits/a090ab6248cf2a1fefe4f9741ce5dc895d103460/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T08:59:37Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T08:59:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix/deserialize responses (#611)\n\n## 🐛 Fix deserialization error responses\n\nMalformed query parameter values (invalid base64, percent-encoding, or\nJSON) and malformed\npercent-encoded URL path parameters previously caused unhandled errors\nor server crashes.\nThis PR catches those errors and responds with a proper 400 Bad Request.\n\n### Changes\n\n- **`@furystack/rest`**: `decode()` now wraps its decoding pipeline in a\ntry/catch and throws\n`RequestError` with status 400 instead of letting raw\n`DOMException`/`URIError`/`SyntaxError` propagate\n- **`@furystack/rest-service`**: `ApiManager.onMessage()` catches\n`URIError` from `path-to-regexp`\n  route matching and returns a 400 response via `ErrorAction`\n- Added unit tests for `decode()` error paths and integration tests for\nboth query and path parameter cases","tree":{"sha":"b655c4b339c7ec60372068f1ec63a2266b313d11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/trees/b655c4b339c7ec60372068f1ec63a2266b313d11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/furystack/git/commits/a090ab6248cf2a1fefe4f9741ce5dc895d103460","verification":{"payload":"tree b655c4b339c7ec60372068f1ec63a2266b313d11\nparent 7d62385c5f73a4a4e57d9bdc3dcb1c72ba34368a\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772441977 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772441977 +0000\n\nFix/deserialize responses (#611)\n\n## 🐛 Fix deserialization error responses\n\nMalformed query parameter values (invalid base64, percent-encoding, or\nJSON) and malformed\npercent-encoded URL path parameters previously caused unhandled errors\nor server crashes.\nThis PR catches those errors and responds with a proper 400 Bad Request.\n\n### Changes\n\n- **`@furystack/rest`**: `decode()` now wraps its decoding pipeline in a\ntry/catch and throws\n`RequestError` with status 400 instead of letting raw\n`DOMException`/`URIError`/`SyntaxError` propagate\n- **`@furystack/rest-service`**: `ApiManager.onMessage()` catches\n`URIError` from `path-to-regexp`\n  route matching and returns a 400 response via `ErrorAction`\n- Added unit tests for `decode()` error paths and integration tests for\nboth query and path parameter cases","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJppVF5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1LMQAFTtXHya3E4Md2tOhX65QBQg\nc8GQDian8UWgn5Rp/5NTCuFerNTxfuyCVte+X0OVUq0mdXUWJKZtWCZnLzCuFGOf\nXwzkbLCrrC1U2PffZOuevM2qXXSd54OBfT44b3GKIozXIdw5Yw9QH0D1gMqSWs8u\n/ZpfEMpq3zDq3swyERA6fgwLxaOjjWpbBi3mpl64vxC4kkSWy+yRJ8X9/RxyiJUn\nP0zbZXmL8DIwjkByuKP1f8r9IasZ/y+nlazT29oDn1K5OUFDpyblrAsWcTX21yQ0\nXNEqjYYkeSbTgNVnpETaYl7OSF05mq2e0hmS2znoW33UDeHGLZlLLh1l8l3k74+0\n/eNM5KOis659L9SA+RUQLRJBezNJp491vMdfFC1NZD2oWnX86wTwTOINrUS8Y26J\n6UvxNrUDaEEPq5SdQGzaRvqHx0/SiuLjmawVE1KYt0NC2PF1TkkwIzz8gdSuTWC2\nT8f26bD0svRVVoIcydEvv/6ZK8//5Ihycm9M/OyJSBusRuDQxOhIeIrqyJrPjCh7\nyvUAlSDkkTI1U+N8LB/oIVkHG3MqjNuwPBT8N0QZAb59zM0/0ZbTQ6MMNG7M6l+E\nZUHs0K+X5/d9ESCG4mZqJwYW+JiyeVp2AwRp0mK6rOaZkIuiFr/2nlJgHc3vWRxz\n114nsu1HpIX42NZcIEm0\n=I9Nt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-02T08:59:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ