hub.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.hmip/commits/acd97d86e0472fde32bb0b9bbd96e3b1edaee56e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:48:56Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:48:56Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Merge branch ''refactoring'': the adapter is TypeScript now\n\nThe sources moved to src/ and are compiled to build/, which is what the npm\npackage ships. Objects, states, ids, roles, native fields and sendTo commands are\nuntouched, so existing installations see no difference.\n\nAlong the way: a dependency tree that npm ci refused to install at all, uuid\nwhich is ESM-only and could no longer be required from this build, and\nsetLockState whose signature disagreed with what the dispatcher actually sends.\n\nnpm ci, build, check, lint, 265 unit tests and 72 package tests are green, and\nthe admin build reproduces its output byte for byte.","tree":{"sha":"f075f624cb68f14bf5ce89e2cb35a541244434c4","url":"https://api.github.c