atars.githubusercontent.com/u/149077728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petermeter2000","id":149077728,"login":"petermeter2000","node_id":"U_kgDOCOK-4A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petermeter2000","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.hmip/commits/bbcafcbc81df2997d6e6f9220b972b7aea257012/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T12:44:40Z","email":"149077728+petermeter2000@users.noreply.github.com","name":"petermeter2000"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T12:44:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add methods for cooling settings in home heating\n\nThis PR enables write support for the cooling, coolingEnabled and coolingIgnored properties.\r\nFixes #443 and adds functionality.\r\nYou can now toggle the groups (=rooms) which will be taken in account for cooling (switching coolingignored) - like in the app. Please keep in mind that setting this value to `true` means that this room will not be taken into account when cooling.\r\nThe functionality was tested with a Homematic IP installation and both cooling, coolingEnabled and coolingIgnored in all groups (=rooms) can be changed successfully.","tree":{"sha":"32be60067e04c640698f618aad76f42cb24263be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.hmip/git/trees/32be60067e04c640698f618aad76f42cb24263be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.hmip/git/commits/bbcafcbc81df2997d6e6f9220b972b7aea257012","verification":{"payload":"tree 32be60067e04c640698f618aad76f42cb24263be\nparent 410c64428389c6804265fdf2a533ccb1f33b3120\nauthor petermeter2000 <149077728+petermeter2000@users.noreply.github.com> 1790167480 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790167480 +0200\n\nAdd methods for cooling settings in home heating\n\nThis PR enables write support for the cooling, coolingEnabled and coolingIgnored properties.\r\nFixes #443 and adds functionality.\r\nYou can now toggle the groups (=rooms) which will be taken in account for cooling (switching coolingignored) - like in the app. Please keep in mind that setting this value to `true` means that this room will not be taken into account when cooling.\r\nThe functionality was tested with a Homematic IP installation and both cooling, coolingEnabled and coolingIgnored in all groups (=rooms) can be changed successfully.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs8m4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAjkQAK9Y+/AshhftfSQGJr41A903\nHC0A+MAVr1+RthZR3aXPa7/Jhm0gkdqWwwOmJRd5+EZektBg19ZR5V7nBaaFuDRA\nC+hwLQMkkajv2k0G81e7Mo1Lr1AKMj5pfsgHVkg3Lwcgpa/7xPx/nelIck0M3UJk\nI4dDmj/Zp5nKg+Q4oLdabAoC3GLHcEd8kmVlc22ZRyMGDD0aUtAEv1jtH7Pbfmga\n3RPfGVmdltTmSQa8o1fxcybbgBcMTm3if2sG39umngA0961xI14kAdOlqNEHbwxQ\nCEqJJnI5usOxs77YrC5qR9FDHvw9fsFPumtFuVVk1M3gkmID/LGsKMKW5E7PBpV+\nxJpbvyyO7KVEMNXAwmXFisVE5d0Bs7AO+Od9i2nEGtqewWQ3dtngioYOZ86G1ygg\nBRy2TK4s4lqUJMlTcSJWWTjmmlvcz645+LL4tOUgNsTlovTp2pIjcaqsuhgdp27Y\n1M9VuY/SEd/sbZCBhp0diF6ICqRi+YnR8EreVtqJnKFmuNA3S292uGaDBlZc0EUM\nIU+Qwdol5gaGMSUOZnYAiDBJb4fSa/b4184Qqx+AxXqejyJTzGc+eR55bLkBsQYS\nGfnaiTOUcw6ITGvunTV/QIN0RQhO8gOCuxpS1ZiUGjKQ8Uy5smGv/iAtNaKgcJnq\n3kS9ABUQRQ+7bcW8aMxo\n=9/Xy\n-----EN