email":"github@fischer-ka.de","name":"Ingo Fischer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:25:51Z","email":"github@fischer-ka.de","name":"Ingo Fischer"},"message":"feat: report the DISTANCE_SENSOR_CHANNEL lengths in cm and its interval in minutes\n\nThe ELV-SH-DUSI configures the DUS1''s full 6.5 m range as its default\nreference height and reports it as 650, so the three lengths are cm; both\nreported payloads fit that and neither fits mm, where 174.3 would be below\nthe sensor''s 250 mm minimum. The measuring interval is settable from one\nminute to one hour, the unit the soil moisture interface already uses for\nthe field of the same name.","tree":{"sha":"efcb74f93a61f0537b3fb5accc21136213a263bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.hmip/git/trees/efcb74f93a61f0537b3fb5accc21136213a263bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.hmip/git/commits/3fd2b2bff851be41d972d25292f8bf330b17eeb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11976694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Apollon77","id":11976694,"login":"Apollon77","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTc2Njk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gith