5T22:05:22Z","email":"github@fischer-ka.de","name":"Ingo Fischer"},"message":"feat: support DISTANCE_SENSOR_CHANNEL and FLOOR_TERMINAL_BLOCK_CHANNEL\n\nBoth channel types were reported as unknown, so their devices published\nonly functionalChannelType.\n\nDISTANCE_SENSOR_CHANNEL (ELV-SH-DUSI with DUS1) carries distance,\ncalculatedHeight, referenceHeight, heightActivated, measuringInterval and\ndistanceSensorVoltage. The cloud gives no hint of the length unit and the\ntwo reported payloads only confirm calculatedHeight = referenceHeight -\ndistance, so the three lengths carry no unit rather than a guessed one.\n\nFLOOR_TERMINAL_BLOCK_CHANNEL (HmIP-FAL230-C6/C10, HmIP-FALMOT-C12) carries\nvalvePosition plus the humidity limiter, dew point, external clock,\nemergency operation and frost protection flags. The local pump channel of\nthe same devices carries them too, so it now extends the new type instead\nof publishing its pump times alone.\n\nSINGLE_KEY_CHANNEL gains the four fields the reference implementation maps\nplus visibleChannelIndex, and doorBellSensorEventTimestamp now uses the\nvalue.time role on every channel that has it.\n\nAddresses #1057\nAddresses #1069","tree":{"sha":"e6d9c0da642fe0c6fdbd3ec3e62b4377cce3a3bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.hmip/git/trees/e6d9c0da642fe0c6fdbd3ec3e62b4377cce3a3bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.hmip/git/commits/fee2ecfdab2ddb75131a1bafe68dcd6aa3e89476","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11976694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apollon77/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","h