 point and the slot''s defaults\n\nMain was the one new file without a suite: it covers the document title, the\nmain landmark and its scoping class, and the page event PageWrap sends in\nAuthenticatedPageRoute''s place. The slot gains the two cases its callbacks\ndefault through: a refresh with no username, and a save with no cached account.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64ccfc8b36e9a4d2836847ca38f6e1f09422b67c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-profile/git/trees/64ccfc8b36e9a4d2836847ca38f6e1f09422b67c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-profile/git/commits/9280df050e12d5da6b662895f78ca02a63baa2dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-profile/commit/9280df050e12d5da6b662895f78ca02a63baa2dc","node_id":"C_kwDOCddS_toAKDkyODBkZjA1MGUxMmQ1ZGE2YjY2Mjg5NWY3OGNhMDJhNjNiYWEyZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.