gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/03efbcd940164533ec2cc13c0e3ba4101af9c761/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T03:43:57Z","email":"pmanko@uw.edu","name":"Piotr Mankowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T03:43:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: never cancel the merge-conflict run of a develop push (#4569)\n\n#4568 put every merge-conflict run in one group with cancel-in-progress, so a pull request event right after a merge cancelled develop''s push run and left a cancelled check on develop (8549ea01de). Pull request events still coalesce; a push to develop now gets a group of its own.","tree":{"sha":"1adb6f9dfd7effa3b99802992d7ed8e5033530c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/1adb6f9dfd7effa3b99802992d7ed8e5033530c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/03efbcd940164533ec2cc13c0e3ba4101af9c761","verification":{"payload":"tree 1adb6f9dfd7effa3b99802992d7ed8e5033530c5\nparent 30ce9604a0fc3f035330b5d3b41cee48b283096d\nauthor Piotr Mankowski <pmanko@uw.edu> 1791171837 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791171837 -0700\n\nci: never cancel the merge-conflict run of a develop push (#4569)\n\n#4568 put every merge-conflict run in one group with cancel-in-progress, so a pull request event right after a merge cancelled develop''s push run and left a cancelled check on develop (8549ea01de). Pull request events still coalesce; a push to develop now gets a group of its own.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----