eap exhaustion advisories). The 3.4\nline has no fixed release; 3.5.13 has both fixes.\n\nSpring Data is used for Page/Pageable/PageRequest/PageImpl, the Ozeki SMS\nCrudRepository and the dataexport repositories under\n@EnableJpaRepositories. 3.5 builds against the same Hibernate 6.6 and JPA\n3.1 baseline as 3.4, and like 3.4 it runs on hibernate-core-jakarta\n5.6.15: a WAR built from this commit starts on the dev stack, bootstraps\nthe three JPA repository interfaces and deploys with no bean creation or\nlinkage errors.","tree":{"sha":"90e16adfeb3f3b1255dcdf2e05ac02758e199543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/90e16adfeb3f3b1255dcdf2e05ac02758e199543"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/cc9e332df202142fc2861ebde1e1e055eee2a4f1","verification":{"payload":"tree 90e16adfeb3f3b1255dcdf2e05ac02758e199543\nparent 87de7594ac6bb85e53b9e719fe631dd1b2115fd9\nauthor Piotr Mankowski <pmanko@uw.edu> 1791126204 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791126204 -0700\n\nchore(security): upgrade Spring Data JPA and Commons 3.4.2 -> 3.5.13 (#4527)\n\nSpring Data Commons 3.4.x keeps an unbounded property-path cache keyed by\nexternally supplied strings (two heap exhaustion advisories). The 3.4\nline has no fixed release; 3.5.13 has both fixes.\n\nSpring Data is used for Page/Pageable/PageRequest/PageImpl, the Ozeki SMS\nCrudRepository and the dataexport repositories under\n@EnableJpaRepositories. 3.5 builds against the same Hibernate 6.6 and JPA\n3.1 baseline as 3.4, and like 3.4 it runs on hibernate-core-jakarta\n5.6.15: a WAR built from this commit starts on the dev stack, bootstraps\nthe three JPA repository interfaces and deploys with no bean creation or\nlinkage errors.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwmq8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJZ0QAAysassuCZGaATGgDinaoZvJ\nfIyQ059XuQqRs4Gi8eAlvPUFtFf7evMnuodtv7xIg6hecp1/VSQiIAY1PsKHAKDf\nnTrZKe1SaDDikVaTCXOq22m7ZC/u1+abYe