.github.com/users/pmanko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/64d7c86b5dc57d005d77c7d88f3ed68319f7c24f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:03:22Z","email":"pmanko@uw.edu","name":"Piotr Mankowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:03:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(security): patch Spring, Jackson, FHIR core, Bouncy Castle and beanutils (#4522)\n\nSame-line patch releases for the libraries behind open critical/high\nDependabot alerts:\n\n- Spring Framework 6.2.18 -> 6.2.19 (SpEL and versioned-resource DoS,\n  JavaScriptUtils XSS)\n- Jackson databind/core/annotations/datatype-hibernate5-jakarta -> 2.18.11\n- org.hl7.fhir.r4 and org.hl7.fhir.utilities 6.9.4 -> 6.9.11 (FHIRPath\n  ReDoS fixed in 6.9.9, XsltUtilities.saxonTransform XXE fixed in 6.9.10).\n  6.9.12 is not used because it moves Saxon-HE 11.6 -> 13.0 and\n  xmlresolver 5 -> 6.\n- bcprov/bcpkix-jdk18on 1.84 -> 1.86 (name-constraint bypass)\n- commons-beanutils 1.9.4 -> 1.11.0\n\nManaged versions for two transitive chains: Saxon-HE 11.6 -> xmlresolver\n5.2.1 resolves httpclient5/httpcore5 5.1.3, now 5.6.4/5.4.4; and\nopensaml-saml-impl resolves velocity-engine-core 2.3, whose jar carries\nshaded commons-io classes and metadata, now 2.4.1.","tree":{"sha":"65e757315e388613ce7727f52f90d279362dc00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/65e757315e388613ce7727f52f90d279362dc00c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/64d7c86b5dc57d005d77c7d88f3ed68319f7c24f","verification":{"payload":"tree 65e757315e388613ce7727f52f9