ps://github.com/pmanko","id":711826,"login":"pmanko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMTgyNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/8b35be018800d7862d0f72760efb4358715a6f65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:03:22Z","email":"pmanko@uw.edu","name":"Piotr Mankowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:03:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(security): update frontend lockfile past brace-expansion DoS fixes (#4520)\n\nnpm audit fix, no package.json change. Production dependencies move only\nby patch: brace-expansion 1.1.13 -> 1.1.21 and 2.0.3 -> 2.1.7 (reached\nthrough exceljs -> archiver -> minimatch), dompurify 3.4.12 -> 3.4.16 and\nfflate 0.8.2 -> 0.8.3. Dev tooling moves within its declared ranges\n(cypress 15.21.1, vite 8.3.2, vitest 4.1.11), which also clears the\ndev-only js-yaml, nanoid, browserslist and extract-zip advisories.\n\nnpm audit now reports no high or critical findings. The four remaining\nmoderate findings are uuid under exceljs, which npm can only resolve by\ndowngrading exceljs to 3.4.0.","tree":{"sha":"10162c7ad97b53a492e2d1e7b53248679a7b5f83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/10162c7ad97b53a492e2d1e7b53248679a7b5f83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/8b35be018800d7862d0f72760efb4358715a6f65","verification":{"payload":"tree 10162c7ad97b53a492e2d1e7b53248679a7b5f83\nparent 5352403cd560bbc6c422af2624840c1944c2d8b7\nauthor Piotr Mankows