/af759dc3f1def475d6e65163e6d433c7451f9ab0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29783151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mozzy11","id":29783151,"login":"mozzy11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzgzMTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/85001620351eae1092c1f17921c4f780b019b18d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:31:01Z","email":"mozzymutesa@gmail.com","name":"Mutesasira Moses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:31:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(validation): OGC-1418 one-page search for the validation queue (#4513)\n\n* feat(validation): OGC-1418 one-page search for the validation queue\n\nValidation opens on one page with a search box (lab number or range,\nA..B or A.. for \"from A on\"), a Lab Unit list holding only the units the\nuser validates, a date range and a patient search. Criteria combine, are\nkept in the address, and clearing one keeps the rest. The old menu\naddresses open the page with the equivalent filter.\n\nThe menu item now opens /validation and its twelve per-search entries are\nretired (Liquibase 114, menu configs, admin menu pages). Release all\nclear releases only what the current search shows.\n\nAlso fixes Study Menu submit, which posted to /rest/menu/ and got a 404.\n\n* fix(validation): OGC-1418 keep vector pool results under a Lab Unit\n\nThe Lab Unit query inner-joined the sample item, so pool analyses never\nshowed under a unit, and a unit-only Release all clear ran on the legacy\nloader. Releasing a pool result then crashed building its FHIR\nDiagnosticReport; the specimen now resolves through the pool anchor.\n\nA one-page list sizes Items per page from its own rows, a Lab Unit the\nuser does not validate is dropped from the address, and the menu\nrollback restores the study entries from the Study Management setting.","tree":{"sha":"5a0acca7c9b4267eefd66c37e00150966cd45ed1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/5a0acca7c9b4267eefd66c37e00150966cd45ed1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/85001620351eae1092c1f17921c4f780b019b18d","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a0acca7c9b4267eefd66c37e00150966cd45ed1\nparent 810d13b2af722a66ddc1481f6a17e2ab8b87ed72\nauthor Mutesasira Moses <mozzymutesa@gmail.com> 1790955061 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790955061 +0300\n\nfeat(validation): OGC-1418 one-page search for the validation queue (#4513)\n\n* feat(validation): OGC-1418 one-page search for the validation queue\n\nValidation opens on one page with a search box (lab number or range,\nA..B or A.. for \"from A on\"), a Lab Unit list holding only the units the\nuser validates, a date range and a patient search. Criteria combine, are\nkept in the address, and clearing one keeps the rest. The old menu\naddresses open the page with the equivalent filter.\n\nThe menu item now opens /validation and its twelve per-search entries are\nretired (Liquibase 114, menu configs, admin menu pages). Release all\nclear releases only what the current search shows.\n\nAlso fixes Study Menu submit, which posted to /rest/menu/ and got a 404.\n\n* fix(validation): OGC-1418 keep vector pool results under a Lab Unit\n\nThe Lab Unit query inner-joined the sample item, so pool analyses never\nshowed under a unit, and a unit-only Release all clear ran on the legacy\nloader. Releasing a pool result then crashed building its FHIR\nDiagnosticReport; the specimen now resolves through the pool anchor.\n\nA one-page list sizes Items per page from its own rows, a Lab Unit the\nuser does not validate is dropped from the address, and the menu\nrollback restores the study entries from the Study Management setting.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv841CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXG0QAHEIY8+HJd2bwrWXm03UxggK\n1E4cCSBalRmxL4eHjPv2oemppXLNvBt13yismffZrhdx3fn4T5Ce/gExqIFuj5tL\nEvT22OKs9halmFVv5e88Ob22pPH116VoWwUMm9HbvI4iLMkIeovP8VF8APCby9Gz\nug2oH0SCTwJZVisPDioW+PpaDcWWr+jdFIdm3z9ZYp78RfeJxQqrfE7w/CEmSvVK\nA/d8asrFT2P9GUdpCu6nn6l2L5Yfa02WpCLFAIludAJ5EswpZa9s2rnQ9hgQjPKE\njDGu3apbS5pIP9+mElFswUhnlOU7jB/0AGbvbhAW3XK+cDnkKuKpul+D9p6w3Bfx\n3ARzGZLsWiVDlaLc6aDMAh7IUQ0cJkfBzsXf+oTZPt+JXTt/o011CVs7w8naShQW\npA9GQH/tqMZrT5rvMxCSK8mqTAy8WUxrXmRBpYAnJTSjo9xaj9LZRXDhjIY8rtyG\nAf3XUl8H7wMmUmpw0pscphMd+kZXZzUqgB6maQ+TMrISG8csMYauu3BiF6AtB4+N\nkpEcBW7cd4wP5TGQ6fus92h7blmmfXK7GlNBYZWilzWJGHab2CHH6G9oS/KpIPXc\n7Nsf6+8wNdK+y1NVo0bOGjWrUvCtfCUT0n8Gd1TpDdroybEhR+dQuWZEjVkJ18vv\nmoiheVi4bcXQfWechFBg\n=r8HX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T15:31:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","re