pi.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/234892f68ddd5ec6a340cd68dd20474b1239ab11"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/711826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pmanko","id":711826,"login":"pmanko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMTgyNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmanko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/12c7761788f516a95822c7c88d2b051b51d74549/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:14:59Z","email":"pmanko@uw.edu","name":"Piotr Mankowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:14:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(analyzers): put the analyzer docs on the site and drop the finished E2E CI plans (OGC-1412) (#4508)\n\n* docs(analyzers): put the analyzer docs on the site and drop the finished E2E CI plans\n\nThe mkdocs site had no analyzer section although three accurate analyzer\ndocs exist. They join the Develop section. The catalog doc''s link to the\nroadmap under specs/ is replaced with a GitHub link, since the site only\nserves docs/.\n\nThe catalog doc now records what the old evidence doc had claimed and\ncould not verify: the respiratory COVID test''s primary result is the\ncategorical overall call, and its only numeric components are the\nnon-primary N2 and E Ct values seeded by 055-seed-molecular-components.\n\nFour E2E CI plans described a hardening that has since landed and cited\nworkflows deleted in April (e2e-pending-status.yml and the two\ne2e-playwright-analyzer-harness-*.yml). The two documents that README\nand AGENTS.md point at stay; the architecture reference loses the\nplugin-jars artifact removed in #4506.\n\n* docs(ci): leave the E2E architecture spec to the plugin removal\n\nThe spec''s plugin and e2e-plugin-jars lines describe the Shared Build\nworkflow, which still builds plugins on this branch. #4506 removes that\nbuild and now carries the matching spec edit.","tree":{"sha":"ab41d271cb4374a7478c844ea943d513f672a73c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/ab41d271cb4374a7478c844ea943d513f672a73c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/12c7761788f516a95822c7c88d2b051b51d74549","verification":{"payload":"tree ab41d271cb4374a7478c844ea943d513f672a73c\nparent 32bec688027f3cf8ef04efb95263212fd83c2232\nauthor Piotr Mankowski <pmanko@uw.edu> 1790946899 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790946899 -0700\n\ndocs(analyzers): put the analyzer docs on the site and drop the finished E2E CI plans (OGC-1412) (#4508)\n\n* docs(analyzers): put the analyzer docs on the site and drop the finished E2E CI plans\n\nThe mkdocs site had no analyzer section although three accurate analyzer\ndocs exist. They join the Develop section. The catalog doc''s link to the\nroadmap under specs/ is replaced with a GitHub link, since the site only\nserves docs/.\n\nThe catalog doc now records what the old evidence doc had claimed and\ncould not verify: the respiratory COVID test''s primary result is the\ncategorical overall call, and its only numeric components are the\nnon-primary N2 and E Ct values seeded by 055-seed-molecular-components.\n\nFour E2E CI plans described a hardening that has since landed and cited\nworkflows deleted in April (e2e-pending-status.yml and the two\ne2e-playwright-analyzer-harness-*.yml). The two documents that README\nand AGENTS.md point at stay; the architecture reference loses the\nplugin-jars artifact removed in #4506.\n\n* docs(ci): leave the E2E architecture spec to the plugin removal\n\nThe spec''s plugin and e2e-plugin-jars lines describe the Shared Build\nworkflow, which still builds plugins on this branch. #4506 removes that\nbuild and now carries the matching spec edit.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv65TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfQwQAAjhUa5uurGBqqYr/uTGrupu\nsYhqwkcA1Uq3tvZ9+Rf90LmGb5iCxsyTiOzFxNzZzpEAsmOkY+qO+CWNk2+CE6Cj\n6LlhaIYIeOIpd75EutABF9pOT+efqC00kWd6WYvovGKBr8pL7GvwUMe/NLrKUimV\n504UJjZ+WJBetS4Dn/zI1DVOkcU3VoHdo3hG+D4HyHc1LGeHfuqEJ6XmDXYwjof3\nMdrh/N1Ek+1F686OJWHNqJu00gVmnfGY10+tarXKWph29ZaP38MeapgkocTAcOL+\nmQuboHRW/EioM9SKzLAUaBqEiWIIiPYOzitLP0UTkQLP/1IFDcY9KX6ibencwpoq\ntPO+Ja1UAOz1ql4QyDcpZmlnxMcg+BSAc+mykphy8jOHeZgiYcgIwD1pEzBlsa/G\nTuUg0lGnLucvWCIcvQ8mhvzViLQLliMWTjWfDZxuYQfnYa2b7uqyJCeywgQxTu/c\nqGtzHiZ9dyQVRvfOSkU4914r0h6x5f81r0mwT1Ugwx5+5umBOmb7LkXCXvLjMRO4\n5YAOMQW58zX4h9sS8bBTLnKZInOBRVQw/04syOyuIUj+0RECOoXAmb76IJB70KPu\nTnUn6uz1z7u5yfA43mC3kcnjZujaGTY5bketzYRkPdz5YpMcPHKnemyQ7J2drlar\nwS8qtcjkQAdqPhbVWKWR\n=gBh7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T13:15:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/we