c2232/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:14:22Z","email":"pmanko@uw.edu","name":"Piotr Mankowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:14:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(analyzers): remove the harness virtual serial ports (#4507)\n\nThe harness ran a socat container that created five virtual serial\ndevice pairs and mounted them into the OpenELIS container at\n/dev/serial. OpenELIS never reads a serial port: serial analyzers are\nthe Bridge''s job, and the Bridge service had no such mount. No test,\nscript or document referred to the devices.","tree":{"sha":"026a7d729820bba9e094f159a3ff8aac126ddc9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/026a7d729820bba9e094f159a3ff8aac126ddc9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/32bec688027f3cf8ef04efb95263212fd83c2232","verification":{"payload":"tree 026a7d729820bba9e094f159a3ff8aac126ddc9f\nparent 864a63ad584106736ea356e87536e53d84094ffa\nauthor Piotr Mankowski <pmanko@uw.edu> 1790946862 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790946862 -0700\n\nchore(analyzers): remove the harness virtual serial ports (#4507)\n\nThe harness ran a socat container that created five virtual serial\ndevice pairs and mounted them into the OpenELIS container at\n/dev/serial. OpenELIS never reads a serial port: serial analyzers are\nthe Bridge''s job, and the Bridge service had no such mount. No test,\nscript or document referred to the devices.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv64uCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxuYQAINJBl+9ZI3+fcKA/ECBZ2sq\nlLOjK/phnUoFXhKeaYA1shvLRK/qJ61Uj7Cib2T1k2dZTV64aOiT5j2d/3ctOJ9o\nZrZhUXJtSCXweCweVvMBXVPspTMQZAAQrAEsseE4fnmzc37YQ6V8FByHXWsl5t0y\nFSKELknSc6gCOHGTsV1gzXzCXklYatZtc3zLo+XpgiCScOjJxjiplWKnviodncdf\nZ6BdLnXvPwfDfzJrTyYMDswVDD0NFkfFErC0UMZW2+p7pNL4RnJQclvmF3efU9Nk\nVNa4TLWkFRBIlmq69l2h2A5ZpqH3jhgnEGaeAFCd1RJ2KqwrQ5RA9hjJ1R3rm20x\nHFoepWI1e