b.com/users/samuelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/a3b6d23b8da920e0817ff353f93f920d90f7a9af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T08:40:31Z","email":"samuelsmalek@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Male"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T08:40:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(eqa): retire the System Settings tab that rewrote lab-wide alert settings (OGC-1247) (#4475)\n\nThe tab''s controls were read by nothing in EQA, and its Save posted to\nthe lab-wide alert endpoint that Cold Storage Alert Settings owns: it\nswitched equipment-failure email, blanked the supervisor email, and\nstored a day count as an escalation delay in minutes. Scheme\nadministration now shows the scheme list directly, as the V2 design\nfolds per-scheme settings onto the scheme form.","tree":{"sha":"b6fdbece9c78ba28c5b4cc4f043797bff03b2c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/b6fdbece9c78ba28c5b4cc4f043797bff03b2c4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/a3b6d23b8da920e0817ff353f93f920d90f7a9af","verification":{"payload":"tree b6fdbece9c78ba28c5b4cc4f043797bff03b2c4b\nparent 10d82d2a0840610d897ff021ca5b1a44f2354c9f\nauthor Samuel Male <samuelsmalek@gmail.com> 1790930431 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790930431 +0300\n\nfix(eqa): retire the System Settings tab that rewrote lab-wide alert settings (OGC-1247) (#4475)\n\nThe tab''s controls were read by nothing in EQA, and its Save posted to\nthe lab-wide alert endpoint that Cold Storage Alert Settings owns: it\nswitched equipment-failure email, blanked the supervisor email, and\nstored a day coun