(validation): attachments stay read-only on the validation review panel (#4504)\n\nThe validation review panel passed editable={false} to the shared Attachments section, but the section never read the prop, so validators were offered an Add attachment button. Attachments are added during order entry and results entry; validation now lists them with View and Download only. Results entry keeps its upload whatever the row''s edit state, as before.","tree":{"sha":"aa1777dcf4fcd09e322e42a76ac5137eb33353cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/aa1777dcf4fcd09e322e42a76ac5137eb33353cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/fbc0565c8cde7c37fd61e113b4c4b0afca444765","verification":{"payload":"tree aa1777dcf4fcd09e322e42a76ac5137eb33353cf\nparent 313490dc7f3d8aaff103d6b836b8eddb62a1f6cd\nauthor Mutesasira Moses <mozzymutesa@gmail.com> 1790915770 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790915770 +0300\n\nfix(validation): attachments stay read-only on the validation review panel (#4504)\n\nThe validation review panel passed editable={false} to the shared Attachments section, but the section never read the prop, so validators were offered an Add attachment button. Attachments are added during order entry and results entry; validation now lists them with View and Download only. Results entry keeps its upload whatever the row''s edit state, as before.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvzS6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI4YQAG0Kzbq/qAnUZzKwUCJbz12V\nWHiR87LvPEHz8zSCOT2xNBwmHsWMaYBKCVEQfNjITKWS/yQZudvHdIQCWTK/gQk+\nbO76jUr/7N/1UCArxrJbCkrhKbS3FoFHyHb4XorSwnO3UYcFe6RzIB9MEHBCg+/r\nCNJwfd6RjTr1tsOalyjkWsNUkf+j961CXE2UamRVkQ6szVj7fYt37QtN8zm6QEvk\nQ1SKQh6vcTeCVE5jmV4WGN0TNxA7G/gWeTsB2yngqSUNSWTivOlr38W6M6AZVfdY\neNURwKn5keqfih9M0HNQE/sGVivuZ1dMMECvRymp0WjydvBFvkn4aBPurZ8gjCET\nDjbrlfixgOVKEnGLm8bj7gksu+NTmTHic37qLlfMI0Bi0tehJhRYSaqlp72ZkOHY\nkwt6tghq54vckjE412xfczn2LTkKfhLwlV+tU