vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mozzy11","id":29783151,"login":"mozzy11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzgzMTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/313490dc7f3d8aaff103d6b836b8eddb62a1f6cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:39:48Z","email":"mozzymutesa@gmail.com","name":"Mutesasira Moses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:39:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(locations): OGC-1363 Locations & Organizations admin menu with codes, search and CSV import (#4500)\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 identifiers, change log and sampling-site link on organizations\n\nAdds the data the Locations & Organizations menu needs: labelled identifiers\nwith one reporting code (existing codes and CLIA numbers are migrated), an\norganization_change history table, facility category and ownership lists,\nGPS, contact and referral-lab review columns, a ward service type, and a\nlink from every vector sampling site to an organization of the new\n\"sampling site\" type, backfilled for existing sites and kept in step in\nboth directions by SamplingSiteOrganizationSync.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 locations service and REST API\n\n/rest/locations serves organizations, sampling sites, wards and geographic\nareas for the admin menu: a filtered, searchable list that also matches\nidentifiers, former names and ward names; a detail with identifiers, wards,\nreferral review and history; saves with field validation, a stale-save\nconflict and a duplicate-name warning; usage counts and a guarded\ndeactivation that can include children; ward add, edit and move; the area\ntree. Only the organization-based display lists are refreshed after a save,\nso it no longer reloads every catalog. The facility registry sync marks its\nrecords and deactivates only those.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 CSV import, export and templates for organizations\n\norganizations*.csv joins the catalog loader (start-up, reload API and the\nImport / Export page): a preview that saves nothing, Add & update that keeps\nids, Replace scoped to the file''s types and the listed wards'' parents, a\ndecision queue for ambiguous names whose remembered choices resolve the next\nimport, a rename check, rejected rows with their reason, a result report per\nrun, templates and an export in the same format. CSV headers keep their\nwritten case so identifier labels survive a round trip.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 Locations & Organizations admin screens\n\nOne admin menu for organizations, sampling sites, geographic areas and\nimport / export replaces Organization Management and the vector sampling\nsites page; the old routes redirect. Lists keep their filters in the URL,\nrecords open inline with a sticky Save bar and a history panel, wards are\nadded with a required service type, deactivation is guarded by usage and\noffers Undo, and the import page previews, decides and applies. Includes the\nPlaywright spec and unit tests.\n\n* test(locations): OGC-1363 give the import test the shared context\n\nThe import apply test loaded a context of its own for a real catalog loader\nbean. Created mid-suite, that context re-initialised the static TableIdService\nagainst a database other fixtures had truncated and failed on\nDefaultConfigurationProperties, taking SampleEditServiceIntegrationTest down\nwith it. The loader bean now lives in AppTestConfig with auto-loading off and\na temp configuration directory in common.properties, so every test shares one\ncontext.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 cap the name and email fields at their column lengths\n\nThe other address fields already stop at their column widths; name (200 after this change) and email (255) now do too, so a long value is refused in the form instead of failing on save.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 show progress while an import file is read or applied\n\nPreview and Apply now show an inline loading indicator while the server reads and matches the file, so a large import does not look stalled.","tree":{"sha":"41b3d535907e23c1d2b5e9d14620b46c5cef9e41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/41b3d535907e23c1d2b5e9d14620b46c5cef9e41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/313490dc7f3d8aaff103d6b836b8eddb62a1f6cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 41b3d535907e23c1d2b5e9d14620b46c5cef9e41\nparent d0e9b7a3c7edb5daca54bd775fd5f5c82a5e2a9a\nauthor Mutesasira Moses <mozzymutesa@gmail.com> 1790876388 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790876388 +0300\n\nfeat(locations): OGC-1363 Locations & Organizations admin menu with codes, search and CSV import (#4500)\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 identifiers, change log and sampling-site link on organizations\n\nAdds the data the Locations & Organizations menu needs: labelled identifiers\nwith one reporting code (existing codes and CLIA numbers are migrated), an\norganization_change history table, facility category and ownership lists,\nGPS, contact and referral-lab review columns, a ward service type, and a\nlink from every vector sampling site to an organization of the new\n\"sampling site\" type, backfilled for existing sites and kept in step in\nboth directions by SamplingSiteOrganizationSync.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 locations service and REST API\n\n/rest/locations serves organizations, sampling sites, wards and geographic\nareas for the admin menu: a filtered, searchable list that also matches\nidentifiers, former names and ward names; a detail with identifiers, wards,\nreferral review and history; saves with field validation, a stale-save\nconflict and a duplicate-name warning; usage counts and a guarded\ndeactivation that can include children; ward add, edit and move; the area\ntree. Only the organization-based display lists are refreshed after a save,\nso it no longer reloads every catalog. The facility registry sync marks its\nrecords and deactivates only those.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 CSV import, export and templates for organizations\n\norganizations*.csv joins the catalog loader (start-up, reload API and the\nImport / Export page): a preview that saves nothing, Add & update that keeps\nids, Replace scoped to the file''s types and the listed wards'' parents, a\ndecision queue for ambiguous names whose remembered choices resolve the next\nimport, a rename check, rejected rows with their reason, a result report per\nrun, templates and an export in the same format. CSV headers keep their\nwritten case so identifier labels survive a round trip.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 Locations & Organizations admin screens\n\nOne admin menu for organizations, sampling sites, geographic areas and\nimport / export replaces Organization Management and the vector sampling\nsites page; the old routes redirect. Lists keep their filters in the URL,\nrecords open inline with a sticky Save bar and a history panel, wards are\nadded with a required service type, deactivation is guarded by usage and\noffers Undo, and the import page previews, decides and applies. Includes the\nPlaywright spec and unit tests.\n\n* test(locations): OGC-1363 give the import test the shared context\n\nThe import apply test loaded a context of its own for a real catalog loader\nbean. Created mid-suite, that context re-initialised the static TableIdService\nagainst a database other fixtures had truncated and failed on\nDefaultConfigurationProperties, taking SampleEditServiceIntegrationTest down\nwith it. The loader bean now lives in AppTestConfig with auto-loading off and\na temp configuration directory in common.properties, so every test shares one\ncontext.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 cap the name and email fields at their column lengths\n\nThe other address fields already stop at their column widths; name (200 after this change) and email (255) now do too, so a long value is refused in the form instead of failing on save.\n\n* feat(locations): OGC-1363 show progress while an import file is read or applied\n\nPreview and Apply now show an inline loading indicator while the server reads and matches the file, so a large import does not look stalled.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvprkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArSsQAJdMLNiZTbr/lWUN8FTcBM1M\nQvHmcpv5JnTtoE+XP3DNyQ4fuWcgulClsJ+67kAheOJye4uKDkxwJxrTI0Ig+GyV\nMGTREd5osilqJK+kpfFP3NDZS1fa7D8hjaC79ELXaFVmvwUSBMbAtCQ9s9Cil1dA\n3MufK8g1kBs5jtDHMxiCT9n5g2DBj3yyGNQh9PdB+NewMy9CmMFsLyBnTHufKFIE\ndSFqk/x/vJuAlOP9eJsh3TebmmCThR6d9Qt97kxGXx8WwHDajwtg7z6FH6HXpA15\nUl9OfPSlo8u3ItJrBaVlQ5Hxgm/DoAO+hBbmaX09zKktmMxa/D2etdxCi6cX9mZr\ny9aLQgEUKQ7CyjgsDEv40ak1Y1Mo3DIOzbF7o5ndtBB0vkQPvWC4gBuNsmYZzS5a\nxTCuCTZmGcE9wESJ0MR1ppNDOtGjsfI8/HhtjQN8lscIKX5uAx73VWngdSrwL+Pz\nkwo3DuRUcyEmxj7pCIjJ2TocqyuNq7em5unZwcsnLdO/sf8mWxab1y+gntmjYhqD\n2FavIBWQbYUCoNZKtR6hMPVkdaC5KPZ90+su7Mf/crCmlHynKLH7kO3Ju7w5v3ZJ\niH/ybGaXgLDsLm2NAhaTcnzypVSgQ3iwtJNBLKGAgGtYUGu6btcz15dZ5A7eiXQN\nWJYwd3cKJjJZmVMmkRPB\n=Scns\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T17:39:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/