ail":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(analyzers): pin the analyzer bridge to 3.2.6 (OGC-1409) (#4497)\n\n* chore(analyzers): run the harness against the Bridge authentication change\n\nPoints tools/openelis-analyzer-bridge at openelis-analyzer-bridge#73,\nwhich requires HTTP Basic on every Bridge endpoint except the health\nstatus. The harness builds the Bridge from this submodule, so the\nanalyzer E2E shards exercise it before it is released as 3.2.6.\n\nBoth harness stacks publish the Bridge API on 127.0.0.1 only; the\nhost-side tests reach it on localhost. The stale comment about OE\nsending forwardAddress orders goes, since OE no longer sends orders\nthrough the Bridge.\n\n* chore(analyzers): pin the analyzer bridge to release 3.2.6","tree":{"sha":"58b94857b06201fdfed845c7d68b1c5bea62ae00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/58b94857b06201fdfed845c7d68b1c5bea62ae00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/e8e8552a73ef2bb50cd72de1c7aa1b11479fcb54","verification":{"payload":"tree 58b94857b06201fdfed845c7d68b1c5bea62ae00\nparent 96b1b204b76b42872c04914079adc2e8dca9add5\nauthor Piotr Mankowski <pmanko@uw.edu> 1790865175 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790865175 -0700\n\nchore(analyzers): pin the analyzer bridge to 3.2.6 (OGC-1409) (#4497)\n\n* chore(analyzers): run the harness against the Bridge authentication change\n\nPoints tools/openelis-analyzer-bridge at openelis-analyzer-bridge#73,\nwhich requires HTTP Basic on every Bridge endpoint except the health\nstatus. The harness builds the Bridge from this submodule, so the\nanalyzer E2E shards exercise it before it is released as 3.2.6.\n\nBoth harness stacks publish the Bridge API on 127.0.0.1 only; the\nhost-side tests reach it on localhost. The stale comment about OE\nsending forwardAddress orders goes, since OE no longer sends orders\nthrough the Bridge.\n\n* chore(analyzers): pin the analyzer bridge to rel