s/mozzy11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/b7429c5fc22a69b042e16cffebae89bb900d9cd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:47:40Z","email":"mozzymutesa@gmail.com","name":"Mutesasira Moses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:47:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(order): OGC-1406 save every added sample, whatever its position (#4481)\n\nModify Order, Add Order and the NoteBook now save every added sample that has tests, even when Sample 1 is blank; a sample with a type but no test blocks Submit and is named. Modify Order and the NoteBook stop offering the reference-lab referral, which the edit save never stored. Also fixed: Modify Order''s test tables keyed rows by test id (one sample shown twice, a cancel or add hit every sample), and a validation loop while site settings loaded that blocked the environmental/vector redirect (the flaky OGC-1192 E2E test). Tested with new vitest and Playwright specs that fail on develop, a live walk with DB checks, two independent reviews, and green CI including E2E.","tree":{"sha":"da2b33d82f5c391c8fe373ffadcdd4f2170eaba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/da2b33d82f5c391c8fe373ffadcdd4f2170eaba8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/b7429c5fc22a69b042e16cffebae89bb900d9cd1","verification":{"payload":"tree da2b33d82f5c391c8fe373ffadcdd4f2170eaba8\nparent 26502892164548bd204637c9c672882b39db1e99\nauthor Mutesasira Moses <mozzymutesa@gmail.com> 1790725660 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790725660 +0300\n\nfix(order): O