com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/fc9c6edb148cd2a61104135ad50e629b6d43d096/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:43:06Z","email":"mozzymutesa@gmail.com","name":"Mutesasira Moses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:43:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(order): OGC-1375 refuse a future date of birth, keep a blank next visit blank (#4477)\n\nA typed future date of birth reached the form while the calendar blanked the box, so ages went negative and Save failed on the server''s raw message. CustomDatePicker now refuses a typed date past a disallowed bound in the field with a translatable message the caller can override, drops it once the box is cleared, and the patient form never shows negative ages.\n\nAdd Order no longer fills Date of next visit with today on first render, so a blank field stays blank. Requester names carry aria-required when REQUESTER_REQUIRED is on.","tree":{"sha":"95d6bd029ec7a5c41d371d1a8bf750cccf5ac890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/95d6bd029ec7a5c41d371d1a8bf750cccf5ac890"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/fc9c6edb148cd2a61104135ad50e629b6d43d096","verification":{"payload":"tree 95d6bd029ec7a5c41d371d1a8bf750cccf5ac890\nparent d43ce30c1285600fcf8924ce6ceff6180c0113ff\nauthor Mutesasira Moses <mozzymutesa@gmail.com> 1790678586 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790678586 +0300\n\nfix(order): OGC-1375 refuse a future date of birth, keep a blank next visit blank (#4477)\n\nA typed future date of birth reached the form while the calendar blanked the box, so ages went negative and Save failed on the server''s raw message. CustomDatePicker now refuses a typed date past a disallowed bound in the field with a translatable message the caller can override, drops it once the box is cleared, and the patient form never shows negative ages.\n\nAdd Order no longer fills Date of next visit with to