?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mozzy11","id":29783151,"login":"mozzy11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzgzMTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/b891bbbf6c72f29a690067c98416f3a5bad2ca4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:37:40Z","email":"mozzymutesa@gmail.com","name":"Mutesasira Moses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T09:37:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dates): OGC-1378 save picked dates on the day picked east of UTC (#4474)\n\nScreens that took a picked date from toISOString() saved or sent the previous day in any browser east of UTC. Compliance standard dates, holidays, the Laporan Hasil and freezer report ranges, the Environmental Compliance Dashboard defaults (the +1 day workaround is removed), the Required By minimum and download names now use toLocalIsoDate().\n\nThe Y-m-d pickers parse with parseIsoDate, which refuses text in any other shape instead of saving 1 January, and the freezer excursion preview covers whole local days like the PDF. A test scans frontend/src for the toISOString() date pattern, and a Playwright spec pinned to Pacific/Port_Moresby covers holidays.","tree":{"sha":"628fc8e8357a47efab6e17e1b157b677c1574f37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/628fc8e8357a47efab6e17e1b157b677c1574f37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/b891bbbf6c72f29a690067c98416f3a5bad2ca4c","verification":{"payload":"tree 628fc8e8357a47efab6e17e1b157b677c1574f37\nparent 238b2cbfc87bb7f12c116eaedbf09c8eefb268b9\nauthor Mutesasira Moses <mozzymutesa@gmail.com> 1790674660 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790674660 +0300\n\nfix(dates): OGC-1378 save picked dates on the day picked east of UTC (#4474)\n\nScreens that took a picked date from toISOString() saved or sent the previous day in any browser east of UTC. Compliance standard dates, holidays, the Laporan Hasil and freezer report ranges, the Environmental Compliance Dashboard defaults (the +1 day workaround is removed), the Required By minimum and download names now use toLocalIsoDate().\n\nThe Y-m-d pickers parse with parseIsoDate, which refuses text in any other shape instead of saving 1 January, and the freezer excursion preview covers whole local days like the PDF. A test scans frontend/src for the toISOString() date pattern, and a Playwright spec pinned to Pacific/Port_Moresby covers holidays.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu4bkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKUkQAGy9wrTx3x2fRxRP7FWj/wEV\nFI085AsjTVqHxEgsLcUHjgrLHiijnZKqBMXzbNaZdSKxXZxleGNGwWkBlnNGKVR8\n9Z00y2roof0XMl0X83fKCTzIQP9+YLKAR73qLIAsdKe0jR9iJgU82ZZJWABszS8K\ntOLsTYe1MOwB1ZZj/VIeqKi6pc1v8cMHDof1OWBgBtFGz3r+NjMz4nqHW/fi90I1\n4EC1RHgvO/FFPE8Urg/ITauYQGPqtlK/h/iwNgKtsdfHqsqER8g7j5/1rHp9UJn9\nnqM26mRRIifzggUNENNCiDNx9ygGwQvCvXbIQpE8Fq50lxufaPKLStYSuaAWcHH/\nq952qcVmxc451nfUhEIVxpuyi97rXUPK6FjE97usR44r9YzC4X163jjQZoRBOhMZ\nuIjz574aZvfgbJl1wCjCcZqroXZE62HWwrxu4GCaylvZ6gULB2CLNWZm4Q2bqoDB\nvwvJy2PzDN0PXgl0cwsbEQ4BQRPZ0DaqQ30+Uj96FmwgjgXNC23p7WN5tY0NvKlD\n1TaaGU+lc5ScBCSYWnw+CDqOcOq/NgR/XYxzy8HEfbODKELfiTc4QI12ox4s6J99\nJXcXFGn9swf7/4RGZpBl1HR1pZI48lSMR/eJVvYE