er-character timeout in profile preservation check\n\n* test(analyzer): align mapping workflow with molecular RIF answers\n\n* fix(OGC-1220): reconcile backend tests with real catalog and audit services\n\n* fix(ci): use current service context and efficient profile test queries\n\n* docs(analyzers): reconcile current roadmap and evidence boundaries\n\n* fix(analyzers): address polling and deployment review findings\n\n* fix(analyzers): integrate current Bridge and native default workflows\n\n* fix(analyzers): align deployment smoke with shared ASTM listener\n\n* test(analyzers): always exercise first-time mapping confirmation\n\n* test(analyzers): exercise stock FluoroCycler setup and watched file delivery\n\n* fix(test): isolate participant setup and preserve ahead-of-fixture sequences\n\n* test(analyzers): locate the profile-defined FILE directory field\n\n* test(analyzers): close sequence review and reconcile qualified workflow evidence\n\n* fix(deploy): align analyzer images with qualified release sources\n\n* docs: format merged worktree guidance for CI\n\n* fix(e2e): pass isolated analyzer endpoints to parity tests\n\n* fix(analyzers): keep clinical catalog in isolated harness\n\n* docs(analyzers): record harness parity and catalog boundary\n\n* fix(analyzers): preserve lifecycle dialog during pending search\n\n* fix(harness): pin readable mock file publication\n\n* test(analyzers): use whole-test deadlines for state-based waits\n\n* test(analyzers): isolate result stories and pin mock 0.1.3\n\n* test(analyzers): keep editor behavior tests focused on one mapping\n\n* test(ci): run full local PR checks from one commit\n\n* fix(ci): complete full local parity runner setup","tree":{"sha":"639b68f9eb34d5c711e43d50a4c37e949984a0ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/639b68f9eb34d5c711e43d50a4c37e949984a0ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/e0c98726bab7e7f6258bbf07fa7d8173335da20c","veri