site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mozzy11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/commits/340599a4ec7d9189b7599946a9048fff5e852fc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T01:14:47Z","email":"mozzymutesa@gmail.com","name":"Mutesasira Moses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T01:14:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): deploy to testing on a Compose without config --environment (#4465)\n\nThe testing deploy failed with ''unknown flag: --environment'' on the VM''s older Compose, so merged work never reached testing. site_settings now falls back to reading the site''s .env (quotes and trailing comments handled like Compose). Also pins the QA Overview test clock so it passes on Tuesdays, and raises the Dashboard test timeout.","tree":{"sha":"3fd8122b3004352cdf62409c4741ee7589685e2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/3fd8122b3004352cdf62409c4741ee7589685e2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/340599a4ec7d9189b7599946a9048fff5e852fc7","verification":{"payload":"tree 3fd8122b3004352cdf62409c4741ee7589685e2f\nparent 889166b649236c0516f1bfc663f06bb5ad2f556a\nauthor Mutesasira Moses <mozzymutesa@gmail.com> 1790644487 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790644487 +0300\n\nfix(ci): deploy to testing on a Compose without config --environment (#4465)\n\nThe testing deploy failed with ''unknown flag: --environment'' on the VM''s older Compose, so merged work never reached testing. site_settings now falls back to reading the site''s .env (quotes and trailing comments handled like Compose). Also pins the QA Overview test clock so it passes on Tuesdays, and raises the Dashboard test timeout.","reason":"v