(showing no rate when there are none), keeps the picked filter dates, and lists sites that have orders but no results yet. Modify Order opens environmental and vector orders in their own Enter Order page and says when a lab number has no order. A reopened saved order keeps and shows its saved dates, patient and received date, no longer reports unsaved changes, and its saved notice no longer takes the keyboard. Saving an edited order now clears fields the user emptied and keeps the referring id. Backend 7614 and frontend 2991 tests pass, and every change was walked live in the browser.","tree":{"sha":"84995f2d0ce68c04d77c5622f610150dbcde7507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/trees/84995f2d0ce68c04d77c5622f610150dbcde7507"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2/git/commits/889166b649236c0516f1bfc663f06bb5ad2f556a","verification":{"payload":"tree 84995f2d0ce68c04d77c5622f610150dbcde7507\nparent ea65d2e43024a7cded8435afe5a86ee268769e97\nauthor Mutesasira Moses <mozzymutesa@gmail.com> 1790635964 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790635964 +0300\n\nfix(order): OGC-1192 environmental orders in Modify Order and the compliance dashboard (#4459)\n\nThe Environmental Compliance Dashboard counts orders rather than result rows, judges the compliance rate only against results with a threshold (showing no rate when there are none), keeps the picked filter dates, and lists sites that have orders but no results yet. Modify Order opens environmental and vector orders in their own Enter Order page and says when a lab number has no order. A reopened saved order keeps and shows its saved dates, patient and received date, no longer reports unsaved changes, and its saved notice no longer takes the keyboard. Saving an edited order now clears fields the user emptied and keeps the referring id. Backend 7614 and frontend 2991 tests pass, and every change was walked live in the browser.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEG