uthored as .tsx were missing from the manifest and their\ndocumentation pages, causing broken links in the website build. Glob\n.tsx too and map .tsx extensions to .js when resolving dist paths.\n\nFixes #11145","tree":{"sha":"c9f7208bc0938435b40938dc724dee4837365e85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/c9f7208bc0938435b40938dc724dee4837365e85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/cc73f736d010fb8494e5ee56f31749e3a9baedc7","verification":{"payload":"tree c9f7208bc0938435b40938dc724dee4837365e85\nparent c303318fe685a9d6aa37e643a68ae6cc5c994be9\nauthor Cahit Gürgüc <cahit.guerguec@sap.com> 1791193182 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791193182 +0200\n\nfix(tools): enable CEM generation for tsx files (#14114)\n\nThe custom elements manifest analyzer only globbed .ts files, so\ncomponents authored as .tsx were missing from the manifest and their\ndocumentation pages, causing broken links in the website build. Glob\n.tsx too and map .tsx extensions to .js when resolving dist paths.\n\nFixes #11145","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw3BeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKBAQAFmFpoJ9aIctoJSavP44bSzn\npNNpPks+ct+2pUo9mUt9nL7HhQ+KCgn5cjq4LqkIFosKor2yxroEX81ASt7I5Sh0\nWyviHbfzmbBGbDXb0ghNNFxeGrCv8yyzqUfYoxGarM4A8MSE1hM+1AjhO7Vc5hpv\nfmOJTgCnSdYpoEnU51aGl/m1Cb809Dg9v1FgtUZjt7fTHDxAgg3qfk1t50XK1O8K\nwhKT+UAfWl4terOIFDP53Lf5Y1Q+LPFp8GTs1dUeIVMr7Ml8454pxIc7Mec1VO5k\nsWzHOU66ABIf6mhXwDmN2TBHmP5OI2Wm/e21Iy5jVwb8jdsIkLcipwZ4dycJFxG0\ni0respMKIyc85CqCGLl52L9OVtmCTKIjZuZQWq9gYVCC105l1ZQbPnkdNUsiris7\nDPK+HK6/U1ejuMzD5JqwoAXKV0O0KKpGOXDEi8+n4199GBl0R+IJkojwLQehH482\nfVsOTM9AlNUqhKOzjPvJHOtNZ8w/9sjISqMZOCJdtWixsra/G7D+Ifg3LBUJQzCb\nrIswyGM4JCVde032iiLzGZTwyYwy8fazF0Qvv08JmUfmhftprtVanSN+y0c9NbIB\n/yzyHlXqVm9HQQiAjMOB6fdHrBjvgAQ09JyNFZUQ5Yp4LG13zvEw4WvphoohILn/\nS0phhYjLx1N3MEgWEFOC\n=M1e6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T09:39:43Z"}},"committer":{"avat