/api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/940cf82999adb45a525d4259be0fac7f4a680d31","node_id":"C_kwDOCfpnRtoAKDk0MGNmODI5OTlhZGI0NWE1MjVkNDI1OWJlMGZhYzdmNGE2ODBkMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/657c4d9c8474bbc2ebab134057b43ded6fa62198","sha":"657c4d9c8474bbc2ebab134057b43ded6fa62198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/657c4d9c8474bbc2ebab134057b43ded6fa62198"}],"sha":"940cf82999adb45a525d4259be0fac7f4a680d31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/940cf82999adb45a525d4259be0fac7f4a680d31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27560551?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GDamyanov","id":27560551,"login":"GDamyanov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NTYwNTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDamyanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/657c4d9c8474bbc2ebab134057b43ded6fa62198/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:59:52Z","email":"georgi.damianov93@gmail.com","name":"GDamyanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T11:59:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-step-input): resolve getFocusDomRefAsync through nested shadow roots\n\nSince v2.27.0, StepInput delegates focus to a nested ui5-numeric-input,\nwhich itself wraps ui5-input. The base getFocusDomRefAsync() only awaits\none shadow root level, so on first call the inner element wasn''t ready\nyet and the promise resolved undefined.\n\nOverride getFocusDomRefAsync() in StepInput to await its own shadow DOM\nand then delegate into the inner NumericInput''s async variant, threading\nthrough all nesting levels correctly.","tree":{"sha":"d73d0bccf118fd0e242d59044c574fa6d4e67f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/d73d0bccf118fd0e242d59044c574fa6d4e67f3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/657c4d9c8474bbc2ebab134057b43ded6fa62198","verification":{"payload":"tree d73d0bccf118fd0e242d59044c574fa6d4e67f3f\nparent 6bf42b754f8857a425300211f47628da46aa37d8\nauthor GDamyanov <georgi.damianov93@gmail.com> 1790683192 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790683192 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-step-input): resolve getFocusDomRefAsync through nested shadow roots\n\nSince v2.27.0, StepInput delegates focus to a nested ui5-numeric-input,\nwhich itself wraps ui5-input. The base getFocusDomRefAsync() only awaits\none shadow root level, so on first call the inner element wasn''t ready\nyet and the promise resolved undefined.\n\nOverride getFocusDomRefAsync() in StepInput to await its own shadow DOM\nand then delegate into the inner NumericInput''s async variant, threading\nthrough all nesting levels correctly.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu6g4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzUAQAKg/I4qV1mGfmeQgMbmlEaxA\nIwnhgEKShFDd2LrnoEO8ehQuHeLIZZf+0u3P+z6Nst42xRAb6WMzFEer4ElTlOQn\ntZVces9DyT6iLHIqVNW3dFG1oJpzDKwaYLo+x5Q6vgGdcvDqzB89nPcqog5dLPW0\nWTFsHoBM1vB7P5zrtNwFy+7DNL9nwnPFbR0fU8Ebqo