url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/8947430da3d576b9599519ae8bf96af979767074","node_id":"C_kwDOCfpnRtoAKDg5NDc0MzBkYTNkNTc2Yjk1OTk1MTlhZThiZjk2YWY5Nzk3NjcwNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/f98356f39f201372cc9922217d5ce48c3f999ab4","sha":"f98356f39f201372cc9922217d5ce48c3f999ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/f98356f39f201372cc9922217d5ce48c3f999ab4"}],"sha":"8947430da3d576b9599519ae8bf96af979767074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/8947430da3d576b9599519ae8bf96af979767074"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15860295?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unazko","id":15860295,"login":"unazko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODYwMjk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/f98356f39f201372cc9922217d5ce48c3f999ab4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:11:06Z","email":"boyan.rakilovski@sap.com","name":"Boyan Rakilovski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:11:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(ui5-link): clarify navigation vs. action usage and accessible role (#14088)\n\n**Issue**\nA link used to trigger an in-page action, left on the default \"Link\"\nrole with no href, is not activated by some screen readers (e.g. JAWS\nin browse mode), because a link with no destination has nothing to\nnavigate to. The docs did not surface the action use case, so developers\ncould miss that accessibleRole=\"Button\" is required for action-only links.\n\n**Solution**\n- Add a \"Navigation vs. Action\" section to the component overview:\n  navigation -> set href; action -> set accessibleRole=\"Button\".\n- Expand the accessibleRole property note to explain why the button role\n  matters (screen-reader activation), not just when to use it.\n\n**Testing**\nDocumentation-only change (JSDoc); no automated test applies. No runtime\nor API behavior changed.\n\nFixes #14068","tree":{"sha":"4ded645f6efccf8719e3c0d0851f32a42a058b98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/4ded645f6efccf8719e3c0d0851f32a42a058b98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/f98356f39f201372cc9922217d5ce48c3f999ab4","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ded645f6efccf8719e3c0d0851f32a42a058b98\nparent 1f3d8abb8eb5f01ec8bd5caffd8d86549d809cf3\nauthor Boyan Rakilovski <boyan.rakilovski@sap.com> 1790665866 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790665866 +0300\n\ndocs(ui5-link): clarify navigation vs. action usage and accessible role (#14088)\n\n**Issue**\nA link used to trigger an in-page action, left on the default \"Link\"\nrole with no href, is not activated by some screen readers (e.g. JAWS\nin browse mode), because a link with no destination has nothing to\nnavigate to. The docs did not surface the action use case, so developers\ncould miss that accessibleRole=\"Button\" is required for action-only links.\n\n**Solution**\n- Add a \"Navigation vs. Action\" section to the component overview:\n  navigation -> set href; action -> set accessibleRole=\"Button\".\n- Expand the accessibleRole property note to explain why the button role\n  matters (screen-reader activation), not just when to use it.\n\n**Testing**\nDocumentation-only change (JSDoc); no automated test applies. No runtime\nor API behavior changed.\n\nFixes #14068","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu2SKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9VQQAEPHxlz2FTRaHJO5msUVkxGG\nijThIapThe0MV55lVGeckfFpo7ueA1PwaDIcfPa5eDBHW4980ZbCp+MIarFUUstA\nGHE08FG+mBzzYLw1QX2YFHV55qRz2McGDVviB3xvK0YjDvNrhlLXos+xgnrFEZ6l\ne7opOuYPwsrrcfbH1Ab4zFIHkzMir+RbK2bDhTwTIp+rYh5wf6wtnKmS+I8mNc+4\nIa2DqwNvkqd6VQtesHWMbl4Q8WI5rtrilVt5I+gjmGQuhVTNL4VOgPfEc4xDNsHn\n9DOOgY7SFgOTKGFmwjTkbPoq1UUXM+nFkmpqw0orgK5ryrxykyExh0xl8GHyIWDg\ntgpkFs1mLFeCZyLPM+GxYCHZ2ChJ5UZ/21sViUbi9qIds0YWaW1xVGrCh5YRfCiq\nU2Wq4qo7YF3ngfFUkecDAwlNHcI3D8sEVlToKCYQYDonTvyz/1yM+dnWJ54W9Xu+\nibAjrtsmLa8TFwfInL/WmcYWGUVljo+S2ziFI+IcpHiACcLmPAVR565KLml5JsyF\nwpfBa6PNs+zq4LcdQHyxOP28243h8C6pOqXxlqQNhBZWwI8RbQtBfT42G9egyn3T\ncJtHoEOMRXsjD04QibZWgkZaJ8lITyYCLb1tnWdb4tm/c4z3eloCgk1MnY6s2Skv\nonLcaPQFVfGBcq9mtgy2\n=28jo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T07:11:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizat