MzYjA0MDRkMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/448789464aa30682c3bd212895df19c2ac3f9094","sha":"448789464aa30682c3bd212895df19c2ac3f9094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/448789464aa30682c3bd212895df19c2ac3f9094"}],"sha":"bd0f8e6fd8d216b687be7e55c58f07c3b0404d04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/bd0f8e6fd8d216b687be7e55c58f07c3b0404d04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31909318?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nnaydenow","id":31909318,"login":"nnaydenow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxOTA5MzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nnaydenow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/448789464aa30682c3bd212895df19c2ac3f9094/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:11:50Z","email":"31909318+nnaydenow@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nayden Naydenov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:11:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(framework): guard languageAware renders against in-flight language changes (#13840)\n\n## Problem\n\nWhen `setLanguage()` is called without `await`, CLDR data is fetched asynchronously. Components already queued for rendering (via `renderDeferred`) before the language change fires can still enter `onBeforeRendering` / `onAfterRendering` while `localeDataMap` is empty, causing:\n\n```\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''ca-gregorian'')\n```\n\n`_invalidate()` already suppresses *new* invalidations during a language change for `languageAware` components, but components that were already sitting in the deferred render queue before `setLanguage()` was called could still reach `_render()` and execute their lifecycle hooks.\n\n## Fix\n\n**`UI5Element._render()`** — skip the render entirely for `languageAware` components while `getLanguageChangePending()` is non-null. `reRenderAllUI5Elements({ languageAware: true })` re-renders them once CLDR and i18n data are ready.\n\nRe-render all language-aware components only if no newer language change has started in the meantime, so they pick up the newly loaded CLDR and i18n data. If a newer language change has started, this one bails out entirely and lets the newer change own the re-render.\n\n## Test changes\n\n- Unskips the `DatePicker` Cypress test suite (was marked `.skip` due to this bug)\n- Updates `setLanguage()` calls in `DatePicker` and `DateRangePicker` Cypress specs to use explicit `return` inside `.then()` so Cypress correctly awaits the resolved promise before proceeding","tree":{"sha":"f68046ba2551c08fb43485dd5bb976ac4bc9aa5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/f68046ba2551c08fb43485dd5bb976ac4bc9aa5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/448789464aa30682c3bd212895df19c2ac3f9094","verification":{"payload":"tree f68046ba2551c08fb43485dd5bb976ac4bc9aa5a\nparent 70f2e43117933570d92033332f2a9b33532ba94f\nauthor Nayden Naydenov <31909318+nnaydenow@users.noreply.github.com> 1790161910 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790161910 +0300\n\nfix(framework): guard languageAware renders against in-flight language changes (#13840)\n\n## Problem\n\nWhen `setLanguage()` is called without `await`, CLDR data is fetched asynchronously. Components already queued for rendering (via `renderDeferred`) before the language change fires can still enter `onBeforeRendering` / `onAfterRendering` while `localeDataMap` is empty, causing:\n\n```\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''ca-gregorian'')\n```\n\n`_invalidate()` already suppresses *new* invalidations during a language change for `languageAware` components, but components that were already sitting in the deferred render queue before `setLanguage()` was called could still reach `_render()` and execute their lifecycle hooks.\n\n## Fix\n\n**`UI5Element._render()`** — skip the render entirely for `languageAware` components while `getLanguageChangePending()` is non-null. `reRenderAllUI5Elements({ languageAware: true })` re-renders them once CLDR and i18n data are ready.\n\nRe-render all language-aware components only if no newer language change has started in the meantime, so they pick up the newly loaded CLDR and i18n data. If a newer language change has started, this one bails out entirely and lets the newer change own the re-render.\n\n## Test changes\n\n- Unskips the `DatePicker` Cypress test suite (was marked `.skip` due to this bug)\n- Updates `setLanguage()` calls in `DatePicker` and `DateRangePicker` Cypress specs to use explicit `return` inside `.then()` so Cypress correctly awaits the resolved promise before proceeding","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs7P2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+SYQAKSLHGsDIOYWjCZaDmCUo3pO\nHCOwqVqKdHe9zhzkcEVEoPlDge1EEtsNngAHYpYsM9Ob3X9U5fwJMGM/0IFkvsek\n2FdFWTB7EoENJ5HwcjvaUoQS2+veSvOaZaiFYsmSan56YUiyWuLmxCrj3km5k0Z7\nJEhWqZMS6Nkp5Ar2hM9oJ+pDB+Vv/MTcSkrKe0ffY+J8aTJGf1TtJuQu3jtUvkp1\n80HdezSsf3NrxLIowcQHFezzoy7P6j8g2Ej2OovFWYqt61btJWMhLzT4l8FIzQrv\nNmeG/foVy5hAw6ThH5Z4ZD8vT6TiWk/Mrim+tNzD/m7XAa23TQkXnorFFKu4xdAq\nmCIveoVzSzNA66teHS2i9WODBx0e1hYB+BcNExCNiJedLr5ZXU0HrAoGMx5IUTtu\ncteh2kznLmdQb4WeJAxIaUfW0AJN3