com/users/hinzzx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hinzzx","id":88034608,"login":"hinzzx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDM0NjA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/38096ec457ec078a270b301bd1821fcc50e8aea1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T07:48:03Z","email":"88034608+hinzzx@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Stoyan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T07:48:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-calendar): add calendar header hover border in HCB (#14069)\n\nPreviously, when hovering the calendar header buttons in HCB (year, month, prev/next in `ui5-date-picker` and other pickers), no hover border was applied.\n\nThis resulted in hover fill to the adjacent calendar backgroundto be about 2.99:1 under WCAG 1.4.11 (non-text contrast), below the 3:1 threshold.\n\nWith this change we align header buttons with lite button hover styling and set an explicit hover and active border, which assures a contrast ratio between the background and hover fill as expected.","tree":{"sha":"59ec8ddacfc637388569efe2638a47309d7cba97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/59ec8ddacfc637388569efe2638a47309d7cba97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/38096ec457ec078a270b301bd1821fcc50e8aea1","verification":{"payload":"tree 59ec8ddacfc637388569efe2638a47309d7cba97\nparent be8fee0056f9c4432c356476e30b5923b330e031\nauthor Stoyan <88034608+hinzzx@users.noreply.github.com> 1789717683 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789717683 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-calendar): add calendar header hover border in HCB (#14069)\n\nPreviously, when hovering the calendar header buttons in HCB (year, month, prev/next in `ui5-date-picker` and other pickers), no hover border was applied.\n\nThis resulted in hover fill to the adjacent calendar backgroundto be about 2.99:1 under WCAG 1.4.11 (non-text contrast), below the 3:1 threshold.\n\nWith this change we align header buttons with lite button hover styling and set an explicit hover and active border, which assures a contrast ratio between the background and hover fill as expected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrOyzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj0IQAC3LmXuXAvthLaB1dpLUPn64\ngVsDqGNlCpXwYtqYozGtIu6hZcex02bBFJJAEdL8jybaqPOdRe5NeUharxJq671M\nWKyLSW4SVPz8wDGGbw0D+DOnIZh5hEZ26ep1EQjXq613unz3J/luWInXlo60sVSx\n+sZzTRrcSe8nOcMH/oktCNGbG4RDmNBANcJ04hJ68LVJRGbF+Xjdd7iz6fYvq6Fm\n0WCqn4HKbmVNlyn8YNOwCHEuNZS0flsVjym9WzIQ7MdEPZ1eNPaqvxK3LvNrDPQe\nP1GOcK4XLrFB4jghVz3g6Uxr60yeeZjB9s7ZZ2GbngInCKTvMVB3U8HpQUtkY5/C\ndESSMovKbF2ssnLeR2BBnVkYIwTr1FkPXKlQ4ivUXIlNQpMRc2Fep5EyQVc4Z2Vf\n09kip5l1OKU6NEiiIPVUEzGmHqwpTMV3/U706DipZo2689bTd7plko0EgW4NOzIx\nvr5pnC3qgqAyxPD4LG2aPA0CjKOqBWP/TN5vHlJu5pFPRs0VNmB9sUu7rvofa4v3\ntWVh2Y7UeWS7bN/5xg/7G3SvK05EkNBdnv9OZL24STVjoSgBCUnhxItNPTIQQowy\nTl9/uOohSnPJJSsh6pKmkNIkOyUqtgNDmlmRUgt9kbSvgS1Dekr/LCV7yAlE05N/\n5Tik8otNMEviy43kuJMr\n=jV1b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T07:48:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.