LegacyThemeFamily() to read the cached getBaseTheme() instead of hitting the DOM on every call.","tree":{"sha":"c37af2fb7c49a894d81f7ce42c5f9b0e3112785e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/c37af2fb7c49a894d81f7ce42c5f9b0e3112785e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/f350e53f1871a24aee242ff88e5f60c94cb075c9","verification":{"payload":"tree c37af2fb7c49a894d81f7ce42c5f9b0e3112785e\nparent fa3e8543d49345dd25ea903015bd4575e924b30e\nauthor Nayden Naydenov <31909318+nnaydenow@users.noreply.github.com> 1789392559 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789392559 +0300\n\nfix(framework): cache base theme to avoid repeated getComputedStyle calls (#14051)\n\nisLegacyThemeFamily() was calling getThemeDesignerTheme() on every invocation, which reads getComputedStyle() each time and forces a synchronous style recalculation. Under a custom theme with thousands of icon renders, this produced a storm of forced full-document recalcs — measured at ~27s of main-thread block.\n\napplyTheme() already calls getThemeDesignerTheme() once and stores the result via setBaseTheme(). Switch isLegacyThemeFamily() to read the cached getBaseTheme() instead of hitting the DOM on every call.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqp/avCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAon4QAJi8kjQDnwEcglwDlUBEwiFl\n3QoU+26Nsfmw8rTXqPizmUheJuMhreP8U4rAx4N0kwLAKgEveqVKCEdSpSV84ILi\nTZ0+dAAtgVTFok5JLQjKiKhLp6ZYVmjXejNZMxyjUi95wglpO63wB6Uqa6gnLDRi\nd8TFYv7eY1D4uoNqAaFli9bGI9i0mmsNtPTnOVxL9h47zf21XtXesEqO6hIBJLig\nrM3YyTCfvBcnIqR3tvzJ2EXBIYyBAb1y0RziZXG4CroAgiCWsMHNsFGjKt5u+dGa\nViCejH3D1EvM2neGUPReuwd/LehvfspAd7mNX8SBhF3Z351o5okYz0F9MsjitnEN\n4hpvj+QWRNwgGjRO7+Q9o2CO1yuV1oxjVXGfJk1ApMQpuR3e5wvwOKnyWPetc8K+\nI7XnEzvT7lujMTGhxN4pthtwlNKdg61PHuWMX0846+zSIszCsh7YXX46679/SBH/\nDWpPUIdztlbu+YkkHth2PhiT37pIPDmk7hFjTSDp9EXkWhwIGKJMsA5QAqNxDUnn\n2E/J4tHJDqwxc3vr7Ip8Blqoyn6QcMYDs1NbO4GlNbWzRktXuH+Y+q5NSVRyIrgM\n9sJBrW6tcwSgK6E0uD0vmqquqrUFgOId8