2e8c4fffa29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/b02452d3abea620a7e7884640cb472e8c4fffa29"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88034608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hinzzx","id":88034608,"login":"hinzzx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDM0NjA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hinzzx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/6d394baf8f23d5fe78ae08d828873dc206f5a107/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T06:38:55Z","email":"88034608+hinzzx@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Stoyan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T06:38:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-timeline): scroll horizontally focused items into view (#14030)\n\nPreviously, when navigating a horizontal `ui5-timeline` with keyboard focus, a focused item could remain partially clipped if it extended beyond the scrollport. The item would not become fully visible until focus moved to the next one.\n\nWith this change we scroll the focused `.ui5-timeline-list-item` wrapper into view on `focusin` using `scrollIntoView`, following the same approach used in `Select` and `ComboBox`.","tree":{"sha":"a54adfe281c8ab969de0bd9e58b18f97cf5f76ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/a54adfe281c8ab969de0bd9e58b18f97cf5f76ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/6d394baf8f23d5fe78ae08d828873dc206f5a107","verification":{"payload":"tree a54adfe281c8ab969de0bd9e58b18f97cf5f76ae\nparent 997354be804b9cef341e549f9253b5cdf9698373\nauthor Stoyan <88034608+hinzzx@users.noreply.github.com> 1789108735 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789108735 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-timeline): scroll horizontally focused items into view (#14030)\n\nPreviously, when navigating a horizontal `ui5-timeline` with keyboard focus, a focused item could remain partially clipped if it extended beyond the scrollport. The item would not become fully visible until focus moved to the next one.\n\nWith this change we scroll the focused `.ui5-timeline-list-item` wrapper into view on `focusin` using `scrollIntoView`, following the same approach used in `Select` and `ComboBox`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo6H/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFSAQAF6dfMKcjOMYEjeedGzJty3P\n4b/Kj834+UlJap2FcqYoF3Xs19/0Qh5Z9d/gFxrjkQpUZb9OuJ7azQjrG6c5y3lI\nJKOAldPdvgd3AMv0jsTX41rJZ7uZBaY/naO8RRdt0QyphJ1/R23D9Wbd8JipWXhd\nneUuv8lNgg34FA4NyK2srku/16UjtrsKa0AGYjQBErZ0G3rYsajH2HO4rqHZIbvd\n319LtM6iG3rxsBNo1IBtsoSlgowGRlYzLRUF5frSANxY5BxR2x0oNv4i9dqqiKsh\n+CBgOPxS3/UryAIb/ObQ4vy6u5ZctcopzWBK1EmsKlKKPG75PfON3H0q/cjV3t5d\nLbR0ZgFWbgBG2fM+7QcF7xVgaqS+e+/Fd1YikawnAN9vgLaWc7v97847hjlCPyym\nSzo8NZ3whh3iLBkKaPbRVN9G5z7gTFPEEug+XhsIEHtYtB/FN4rPVy49jzQcFZ1J\n3IwWndXpfixhj1fHFq5Dj/Fu4KkGOnBJzarFxI7djRtSbNDJ6oKsULsrKOT84B51\nb8qgKG79MH41U+P+mXt6PfEhI2oLMKziKsKDwf3ZZv8KRkKhEpSJR1AMKO50R7Zv\na/Y129DiKrJAjrnvux6GorBmSn4hBPL45kl5LbJuas1vxPs1dVY1FdIYtX3ca6r2\njIaAcaf8k/Vv6A78DmJL\n=0y6l\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-11T06:38:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.