onents/git/trees/005c27d169e4e9781588871eca31ca846ec5a42f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/f199ba4e3986de4b2c10a58f5bdb6a50e205e196","verification":{"payload":"tree 005c27d169e4e9781588871eca31ca846ec5a42f\nparent 770baa0d738bee6d74d318517d77a5c995bfc60f\nauthor Stoyan <88034608+hinzzx@users.noreply.github.com> 1788953117 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788953117 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-timeline): prevent clipped focus outlines (#14029)\n\nPreviously, when a `ui5-timeline-item` bubble was focused, the focus outline drawn with `::after` was getting cut.\n \nIn **vertical layout**, the focus outline was clipped at the top and bottom of the first and last items. \n\nWith this change we reserve margin on the bubble for the focus ring offset using the existing theme parameters, apply the same inline-end offset to the group toggle button row.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoUIdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAtcQAGCW0z3yhmSN/uLz69sKchrr\nnJPIlr2EsolJZbEVudROflgtiJavrkgu+lNMGts7AfyEjaoi8y1e4j1X02LFkVDa\nCcNkzXD8CJaWj4QmOR4WjYWymktIRMN7kyL1ND96gm2Dzbjj4JNCuK6j88yb1EyU\nf9riJMBz1psQtdn1tQRWFF73fvfWQABk4G1g3PxnbWraUX28HBeZLHp2RjXC4/2Z\nY6Pmrh6ZONMo2jU9SDAQXfzSQOJt9g8IrXFu4fjypyIPK/95GJmQVhYktlV0fTYo\nXbqZFXKmWriYlb6m2jAFVr8U68KeecOUEaidZZ8Y8+FnnyWkfRJKAuP++AVK4VtP\nmo+ByhMmxtSG1G5BonztDkKPwYEStk7Cfr2wgowSN92IDWpaQ9oy/O+Xg3uVbGbs\nuX7a04NEksCDee68RsDtgahkzvlJdcE5B7frjy79UQK8ThWPCJGLHNQ02BvGtDt3\nDPXfY4b7olGwKKIevMRK08uZSnR9zWJm4Hv0+U1aj3WAT2jjU5V3KnL5RCiOJsFx\n/RblbhDfntAHKxzdMprBy1F12YoM1NSK8m6b+Ye+14Irbgq7TLXUZ/ujiMw6eo52\n5EztXtmXLWRoFY0MSN8jcD75wGCCr2WVlvMo4YM80rsVz02Xstnk7ldQvkoo+6Tc\nbvcLdMtwSTq64lRxNXSd\n=MAeo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T11:25:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo