ts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unazko","id":15860295,"login":"unazko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODYwMjk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unazko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/ba03d30eef0111d4ce56d095b1687ab917cb51b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T12:44:53Z","email":"boyan.rakilovski@sap.com","name":"Boyan Rakilovski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T12:44:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-calendar): translate week number aria-label in DayPicker (#14014)\n\nThe aria-label on the week number container (`ui5-dp-weekname-container`)\nwas hardcoded as an English template literal `Calendar Week ${weekNum}`,\nbypassing the i18n bundle and making it untranslatable.\n\nAdded a new i18n key `DAY_PICKER_CALENDAR_WEEK` with a `{0}` placeholder\nfor the week number, and routed the aria-label through\n`DayPicker.i18nBundle.getText()` via a new `_getCalendarWeekLabel()` method.\n\nFixes: https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/issues/14003","tree":{"sha":"33ef8cfa7c15fd16544d0892176235ff03e50e5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/33ef8cfa7c15fd16544d0892176235ff03e50e5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/ba03d30eef0111d4ce56d095b1687ab917cb51b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 33ef8cfa7c15fd16544d0892176235ff03e50e5a\nparent f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e\nauthor Boyan Rakilovski <boyan.rakilovski@sap.com> 1788439493 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788439493 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-calendar): translate week number aria-label in DayPicker (#14014)\n\nThe aria-label on the week number container (`ui5-dp-weekname-container`)\nwas hardcoded as an English template literal `Calendar Week ${weekNum}`,\nbypassing the i18n bundle and making it untranslatable.\n\nAdded a new i18n key `DAY_PICKER_CALENDAR_WEEK` with a `{0}` placeholder\nfor the week number, and routed the aria-label through\n`DayPicker.i18nBundle.getText()` via a new `_getCalendarWeekLabel()` method.\n\nFixes: https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/issues/14003","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmWvFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7uUQAAgSjP23E58ulfRPG18IqVJS\nsaerkbUYKPiJ3JQdL3tyer8c3SsswJCsSw6Sodfe7OTXMqlr+puXmzXlH5mrW6Fm\n8Xu61uvQVGZzbZVOU5PVlvr1hYqj37NDxnr5tor057ba4/kGL5ALWOOBhNHpIZAi\ndCQTYKsYqQj4a7bVo4bw2IYbntd1akJvJcaGUl/KJ2TascQuFzQs8I6TnpCeFtUX\n2lVTipgyL5sNSYqtxWP/SUw2zs9KLoyZXYmKwJ5iKpxoMav6K9pm29a+I7gwNvp7\nLp5Efmsuq8Rabc/TyWScd+d/FGZrrr0C68R3yUSYUptzqZQPkxAkFnCLU+6RMbLe\nbEOvH78SGu3zDoops0LHQgmxEKBIrLWqUQwGq7CWkmAGsSNoTYsmYWmc5dxmQaQU\nUhG7yPmsPOUAlRVqF9JnAu36Dgq3fD8lXCd9AKuB2SvEhh/5Gf8h+prG1+hNVlLy\n2oqwLlFUFQ6simKALXLO2d4HaskV/zUck1uww5Info1Mhcfb0ssyFF7ezY8kRjt9\nb3ig2/CghWbIXZzyyZ+8h33F2uwfNo0hp2Z67YsI0daQZOA7p9NXLOjeq9PSNB7/\nwxYaVRJeWdc/b1jVr8FBeLE0Qm95fT6tiPx6Yxw3j7i6kz5vEK/wQRXcJvAHeKt3\nU6S+UphZf/I6dZ9Iz5fo\n=kIRD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T12:44:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/ba03d30eef0111d4ce56d095b1687ab917cb51b2","node_id":"C_kwDOCfpnRtoAKGJhMDNkMzBlZWYwMTExZDRjZTU2ZDA5NWIxNjg3YWI5MTdjYjUxYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e","sha":"f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e"}],"sha":"ba03d30eef0111d4ce56d095b1687ab917cb51b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/ba03d30eef0111d4ce56d095b1687ab917cb51b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13866865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamenivanov91","id":13866865,"login":"plamenivanov91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODY2ODY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamenivanov91","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T12:21:59Z","email":"plamen.ivanov01@sap.com","name":"Plamen Ivanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T12:21:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-option-group): remove unrelated inherited public APIs (#13998)\n\nui5-option-group extended ui5-li-group and therefore inherited a number\nof public APIs that are irrelevant to grouping options inside a\nui5-select and were never wired into its template:\n\n- headerAccessibleName property\n- wrappingType property\n- header slot\n- move and move-over events\n- header and title CSS parts\n\nExtract an abstract ListItemGroupBase that holds only the shared group\ncontract (headerText, the default items slot, and the isListItemGroup /\ngroupHeaderItem hooks the internal ui5-list relies on to flatten grouped\nitems). Both ui5-li-group and ui5-option-group now extend this base, so\nthe drag-and-drop, wrapping and header-slot APIs live solely on\nui5-li-group where they belong, while ui5-option-group exposes only\nheaderText and its options slot.\n\nui5-li-group''s public API is unchanged.\n\nAlso add a standalone documentation page for ui5-option-group.\n\nFixes #13992\nFixes #13991","tree":{"sha":"0c705277b7ae72214ec59517036437094189d111","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/0c705277b7ae72214ec59517036437094189d111"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c705277b7ae72214ec59517036437094189d111\nparent 9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621\nauthor Plamen Ivanov <plamen.ivanov01@sap.com> 1788438119 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788438119 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-option-group): remove unrelated inherited public APIs (#13998)\n\nui5-option-group extended ui5-li-group and therefore inherited a number\nof public APIs that are irrelevant to grouping options inside a\nui5-select and were never wired into its template:\n\n- headerAccessibleName property\n- wrappingType property\n- header slot\n- move and move-over events\n- header and title CSS parts\n\nExtract an abstract ListItemGroupBase that holds only the shared group\ncontract (headerText, the default items slot, and the isListItemGroup /\ngroupHeaderItem hooks the internal ui5-list relies on to flatten grouped\nitems). Both ui5-li-group and ui5-option-group now extend this base, so\nthe drag-and-drop, wrapping and header-slot APIs live solely on\nui5-li-group where they belong, while ui5-option-group exposes only\nheaderText and its options slot.\n\nui5-li-group''s public API is unchanged.\n\nAlso add a standalone documentation page for ui5-option-group.\n\nFixes #13992\nFixes #13991","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmWZnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjFEQAEOMhG0X/V2JcDz4+GHpIVBj\nlow8Pj0xz/qDxJw578R+Z988vz+mXXqHAPZDtionxcqI84PenRLIImUQaVUN5gOx\nPO9Z0sMXEy8ZzhAH9qVDXCGybfy0EsHq4SiWd2K+EPgC5Sc5WUSSVpYPezeSfvFg\n+NTdFwMuunN4yAKx0Z7Ih5TmrSc9Hy9aQUfVecdc6gyDOX2+2jZNxWQdPl8e3YsK\n+6Su1HG3wpYN3PAFFzkeVJSqx74vl0WKUpW9aF0/spnUMjgE0VB1cuq03vWmq72Y\nH6mPHRYkNCWm5TwfAjL5eFZc2Jy5ixIQeW0iTtMzS+DFjpWZLbvMHfPzyUn1akXf\nCSFEjEVTz6chlYxzrP5T4YpYyRNFa9+m9FsVxu8S9lhiCkYDwRs+qlB1LcDSgOSo\nnDIWG7Og9IK3kQytEUE+L6W/yTb2jm67+ZmD3btfiO7AITBY4CDfPk7YCQmbGRSs\nynCvSeAVjCri+Iv5ack4hAcxCrsHx7u/QgSRCi3jFFxUzcPDv3xiEai7hryFkv/L\n0JfScPF4bf10TzJLsfY1JMzgYBPJ2tTGucUiQY8z83CLdia45ZSPiEhxM8+aKP2i\nFHQV3HNAaM0FYtjwwbU9IWLHJYynbZRoWxos6aC4rOaFCkQm4NuV7lB7MPwEgv7l\nlSCcKxmIT142CaIatQew\n=pdw0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T12:21:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e","node_id":"C_kwDOCfpnRtoAKGYyYWIwMjhhMjgxYTQyMDViMDA3NGVjZWUwMTllYWNmMzVmMTg1MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621","sha":"9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621"}],"sha":"f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/f2ab028a281a4205b0074ecee019eacf35f1852e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87311182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NakataCode","id":87311182,"login":"NakataCode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzExMTgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:53:56Z","email":"87311182+NakataCode@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nikola Anachkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:53:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-icon): suppress native click propagation for Image mode (#13997)\n\nNon-interactive Image mode already suppressed the ui5-click custom event, but the native click still bubbled up to the host, making the icon appear clickable to parent listeners.\n\nCalls e.stopPropagation() in _onclick for Image mode before returning, aligning runtime behavior with the documented @event(\"click\") specification.\n\nFixes: #13972","tree":{"sha":"f7adb5f4cee495266d34eadbc11dbbddac8b453b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/f7adb5f4cee495266d34eadbc11dbbddac8b453b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621","verification":{"payload":"tree f7adb5f4cee495266d34eadbc11dbbddac8b453b\nparent 2a15c4d6999e41e860a96a663127bebf4ae4d64f\nauthor Nikola Anachkov <87311182+NakataCode@users.noreply.github.com> 1788436436 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788436436 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-icon): suppress native click propagation for Image mode (#13997)\n\nNon-interactive Image mode already suppressed the ui5-click custom event, but the native click still bubbled up to the host, making the icon appear clickable to parent listeners.\n\nCalls e.stopPropagation() in _onclick for Image mode before returning, aligning runtime behavior with the documented @event(\"click\") specification.\n\nFixes: #13972","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmV/UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUhAQAGIFl/pCps3tZ5h8fPYvcy3Z\naBVtqBhGAJfZFa+aZyg06fgh8LhDRBrq4cuvXMpm5GVtkYvN/zcaNuS7VlmzEt1u\n7kDjZhc6n56vSpyW8fPhLg4UFlFGgWJQBkf6v5Rf+PXI32cfvh+dsXVGOg2jpT0N\nSIKf0hYWJVVeBZEOASuDnDOX+wAci4eiB7QBEMfChXEWXVOTZw2ENLs3/C2Aoul+\nqiThfHJJdRpKEUMcvHe9vdgUl9cW4xaIRsLoGDJhSggHXzbeA6hyZwNApBP4b9iu\nwiHc5OrdFnNK6iLmD14vweSm8YnU9dZODYbA+jBbogowxd9CrEixSfI1NLAGDdSN\nSzEc3lNcINZtrFA6LzJEUKJkYAobdjFl6UZk96gJsF+Yw0Fd6lcCiFoRVmFrRb+Z\nR0NyGVNDLGnSDY7B7oZEGoEIIH4h+d/sf9VW1QJp/pRI5AiB64wVgYtnTv6pKshU\n8kZe6sO9852B16WWALGzTuhiuFPaCFEfAOwGh3KEsGtag4Efu8q69hQ44bknsqKr\nsV1AqQdZXEhaUkzpQACNm/+bE5ypg8c6PnrKh7T4hvxgwWBHp2CZQjDOtuZz38TS\nlk3Sa70Y6v8JcQgMJLgzam1q+E4QAn/6DlhAiD64rAe3Trb5q+iv3X7Xx2Zi8y7x\ndCHjhJBS6nw3cOwWg9lN\n=inMj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T11:53:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621","node_id":"C_kwDOCfpnRtoAKDllZDA3YjYyNjIxZTdkNjM5MjU5Yzg3YzNjYmFjYThjNDkzNjM2MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/2a15c4d6999e41e860a96a663127bebf4ae4d64f","sha":"2a15c4d6999e41e860a96a663127bebf4ae4d64f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/2a15c4d6999e41e860a96a663127bebf4ae4d64f"}],"sha":"9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/9ed07b62621e7d639259c87c3cbaca8c49363621"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22766569?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dobrinyonkov","id":22766569,"login":"dobrinyonkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzY2NTY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/2a15c4d6999e41e860a96a663127bebf4ae4d64f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:37:27Z","email":"dobrin.dimchev@sap.com","name":"Dobrin Dimchev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:37:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-list): suppress hidden text announcement for InactiveSelectable items (#14011)\n\n* fix(ui5-list): suppress hidden text announcement for InactiveSelectable items\n\nScreen readers were announcing the raw string \"InactiveSelectable\" for items\nof this type because the hidden text span was rendering this.type verbatim.\nSuppress the span entirely for InactiveSelectable items since no type\nannouncement is appropriate for this state.\n\n* fix(ui5-list): allow selection only via checkbox/radio for InactiveSelectable items\n\nClicking the item body of an InactiveSelectable item no longer toggles\nselection. Selection can only be triggered by clicking the checkbox (Multi)\nor radio button (Single) directly, consistent with Inactive behavior.\n\n* test(ui5-list): update InactiveSelectable tests to reflect checkbox-only selection\n\nItem body clicks, Space, and Enter no longer trigger selection for\nInactiveSelectable items. Updated all affected tests to assert no selection\nfrom row interaction and verify selection works only via the\ncheckbox/radio button directly.\n\nAlso clarifies the JSDoc on the type property to make the narrowed\nselection contract explicit.\n\n* fix(ui5-list): block SingleAuto auto-selection for InactiveSelectable items\n\nSingleAuto triggers selection via item-focused event in List.ts, bypassing\nfireItemPress. Guard against this so InactiveSelectable items are also\nexcluded from auto-selection on focus.\n\nAlso fixes tests for Single/SingleEnd/SingleStart modes to use correct\nshadow selectors and aligns all test expectations to checkbox-only selection.","tree":{"sha":"c6ce4542af3534ba7bb1f3d8344b0dadb88c16f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/c6ce4542af3534ba7bb1f3d8344b0dadb88c16f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/2a15c4d6999e41e860a96a663127bebf4ae4d64f","verification":{"payload":"tree c6ce4542af3534ba7bb1f3d8344b0dadb88c16f6\nparent 36f505f0e159b2fc39ab10020c749495fb3f6d6b\nauthor Dobrin Dimchev <dobrin.dimchev@sap.com> 1788435447 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788435447 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-list): suppress hidden text announcement for InactiveSelectable items (#14011)\n\n* fix(ui5-list): suppress hidden text announcement for InactiveSelectable items\n\nScreen readers were announcing the raw string \"InactiveSelectable\" for items\nof this type because the hidden text span was rendering this.type verbatim.\nSuppress the span entirely for InactiveSelectable items since no type\nannouncement is appropriate for this state.\n\n* fix(ui5-list): allow selection only via checkbox/radio for InactiveSelectable items\n\nClicking the item body of an InactiveSelectable item no longer toggles\nselection. Selection can only be triggered by clicking the checkbox (Multi)\nor radio button (Single) directly, consistent with Inactive behavior.\n\n* test(ui5-list): update InactiveSelectable tests to reflect checkbox-only selection\n\nItem body clicks, Space, and Enter no longer trigger selection for\nInactiveSelectable items. Updated all affected tests to assert no selection\nfrom row interaction and verify selection works only via the\ncheckbox/radio button directly.\n\nAlso clarifies the JSDoc on the type property to make the narrowed\nselection contract explicit.\n\n* fix(ui5-list): block SingleAuto auto-selection for InactiveSelectable items\n\nSingleAuto triggers selection via item-focused event in List.ts, bypassing\nfireItemPress. Guard against this so InactiveSelectable items are also\nexcluded from auto-selection on focus.\n\nAlso fixes tests for Single/SingleEnd/SingleStart modes to use correct\nshadow selectors and aligns all test expectations to checkbox-only selection.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmVv3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdbgQAGzEMpWUfr1bZCBLWzdZpWdS\ncmupRfkDJzBIFfc1/DTONVLrKMeLI1M75MwCEW4hYA8jTJVVyKHYtr+WVafFaoIQ\ndCg9hXz7JigTeJrnw8r/e7ZXmar+t2Sr3sUnfvMMlWtWPAljKqJW5nUSZB0QS0ER\nSZ4Y1Ljh4E/hiE7QIA7s3KPJmEL17i4J2/NA609Z9Ux2WajO529xwMMv41g/bFyD\nWWCkkjIZk10i+YtaD6hPHUMm9IlopJ0wwlFgf1VgISpM5gd4NBh3TrxY1HlitLx1\nttEoTN