tml_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/e85de78e22646435c562fb161ba4ca304a4b0d81","sha":"e85de78e22646435c562fb161ba4ca304a4b0d81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/e85de78e22646435c562fb161ba4ca304a4b0d81"}],"sha":"e48676441edb2abe5313c1d9272defc2d5bd3f94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/e48676441edb2abe5313c1d9272defc2d5bd3f94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7242508?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LidiyaGeorgieva","id":7242508,"login":"LidiyaGeorgieva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNDI1MDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LidiyaGeorgieva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/e85de78e22646435c562fb161ba4ca304a4b0d81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T07:58:02Z","email":"lidiya.georgieva@sap.com","name":"Georgieva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T07:58:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-popover): prevent horizontal position drift on reposition (#13987)\n\nThe popover is repositioned every 300ms by PopoverRegistry. The RTL\ncorrection was added to the persisted `this._left` after the 1.5px\ndead-band check, so whenever the dead-band kept `this._left` unchanged\nthe correction was re-applied every tick and accumulated, causing the\npopover to slowly drift and misalign with its opener. This was most\nvisible at fractional zoom levels, where getBoundingClientRect().left\nis snapped to device pixels and yields a persistent sub-pixel\ncorrection.\n\nApply the correction to the raw left before the dead-band check so it\nis baked into `this._left` once and stays stable across repositions.\n\nfixes: #13863","tree":{"sha":"b19110d7348750f3bf23ef2efe41a58d6395fd76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/b19110d7348750f3bf23ef2efe41a58d6395fd76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/e85de78e22646435c562fb161ba4ca304a4b0d81","verification":{"payload":"tree b19110d7348750f3bf23ef2efe41a58d6395fd76\nparent 1feb9bd65928b83395e20010061b79d4a9200a3b\nauthor Georgieva <lidiya.georgieva@sap.com> 1788163082 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788163082 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-popover): prevent horizontal position drift on reposition (#13987)\n\nThe popover is repositioned every 300ms by PopoverRegistry. The RTL\ncorrection was added to the persisted `this._left` after the 1.5px\ndead-band check, so whenever the dead-band kept `this._left` unchanged\nthe correction was re-applied every tick and accumulated, causing the\npopover to slowly drift and misalign with its opener. This was most\nvisible at fractional zoom levels, where getBoundingClientRect().left\nis snapped to device pixels and yields a persistent sub-pixel\ncorrection.\n\nApply the correction to the raw left before the dead-band check so it\nis baked into `this._left` once and stays stable across repositions.\n\nfixes: #13863","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlTQKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuWsQAHlje8I6TQLEhd5zrojwLx/u\npAQ6+hyLQe0T5oDjwOgChj3PxF1EbrpU4Zq31Z1qv07J+043r7JZ3g6ERXS7VHOD\natgCrJVAR8LFvi+jLrljK0iQe7edgd0KhpF15dzCZle5Q6