1Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(ui5-date-picker): document locale-aware relative date input (#13982)\n\n* docs(ui5-date-picker): document locale-aware relative date input\n\nAdd a \"Relative date input\" section to the component overview\nexplaining that the input field accepts CLDR-based relative\nexpressions such as \"today\", \"yesterday\", \"next week\", and \"last\nmonth\". Notes that supported terms are locale-specific and that\nweek/month/year expressions resolve as offsets from today, with a\nlink to the CLDR Date Fields spec.\n\nRelated to: BGSOFUIBALKAN-11043","tree":{"sha":"ae0987926252af57ca172441d7e57ef628b5a0dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/ae0987926252af57ca172441d7e57ef628b5a0dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/3780ac05f4fccc0e4154ace6724745b2491184f6","verification":{"payload":"tree ae0987926252af57ca172441d7e57ef628b5a0dd\nparent a2d835f3aae2299c84d7a0095334ee515668a57d\nauthor Boyan Rakilovski <boyan.rakilovski@sap.com> 1787903011 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787903011 +0300\n\ndocs(ui5-date-picker): document locale-aware relative date input (#13982)\n\n* docs(ui5-date-picker): document locale-aware relative date input\n\nAdd a \"Relative date input\" section to the component overview\nexplaining that the input field accepts CLDR-based relative\nexpressions such as \"today\", \"yesterday\", \"next week\", and \"last\nmonth\". Notes that supported terms are locale-specific and that\nweek/month/year expressions resolve as offsets from today, with a\nlink to the CLDR Date Fields spec.\n\nRelated to: BGSOFUIBALKAN-11043","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkTwjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAR+0QAEe8pS7AojJumGWjvgNB/XTy\nCn2tJH1P5wdgojixN1LBlPsdUfNUJGa+86QGn7u4abT3aEJY2WyGlTHtWkrBsBSW\nqDImotM/NU22E7z2+T+5EPDxLeeACoJOgKp+h34VS4YbO8OcN1lM/ZmhD4BYn/iX\nAbiVm9z8kApyc+gLeyycwmM6xe9NFPox85gUza/EJCMKw68/FE5dBF5s