"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/b604bb323071db5896a119365d4044c5044d0745/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T07:27:25Z","email":"31909318+nnaydenow@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nayden Naydenov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T07:27:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-icon): replace size containment with font-size for icon sizing (#13981)\n\nSwitch from CSS container queries (container-type: size) to font-size inheritance for sizing the icon glyph. The inner .ui5-icon-root now uses font-size: inherit instead of min(100cqw, 100cqh), and the :host default sets font-size: 1rem to match width/height defaults.\n\nFor fontIcon-slot (font-based) icons, glyph size is driven by font-size — setting only width/height is not sufficient. This is documented on the fontIcon slot in Icon.ts.\n\nFixes: https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/issues/13973","tree":{"sha":"0d102ba46c11449b869514fe599f1068cfa8ff73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/0d102ba46c11449b869514fe599f1068cfa8ff73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/b604bb323071db5896a119365d4044c5044d0745","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d102ba46c11449b869514fe599f1068cfa8ff73\nparent 2fb0efd0052679400af0785d2ca09dcfa5b47756\nauthor Nayden Naydenov <31909318+nnaydenow@users.noreply.github.com> 1787729245 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787729245 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-icon): replace size containment with font-size for icon sizing (#13981)\n\nSwitch from CSS container queries (container-type: size) to font-size inheritance for sizing the icon glyph. The inner .ui5-icon-root now uses font-size: inherit instead of min(100cqw, 100cqh), and the :host default sets font-size: 1rem to match width/height defaults.\n\nFor fontIcon-slot (font-based) icons, glyph size is driven by font-size — setting only width/height is not sufficient. This is documented on the 