on-group, a new public component that allows grouping options inside ui5-select, matching the ComboBox''s ui5-combobox-item-group API pattern.\n\nKey changes:\n\nNew ui5-option-group component extending ListItemGroup, with individualSlots: true and ARIA group semantics (role=\"group\", aria-label, aria-roledescription)\nSelect._flatOptions getter flattens grouped + ungrouped options for all navigation and selection logic\nPer-group aria-setsize/aria-posinset injected via _forcedSetsize and _forcedPosinset on Option, rendered via ListItemBaseTemplate\nHidden live-region span on the Select trigger announces option count and group count on focus (aria-describedby)\nIOptionGroup interface exported from Select.ts for consumers\nWebsite docs sample added (OptionGroups)\nJIRA: BGSOFUIPIRIN-7094","tree":{"sha":"12276c724a1427c72dc2dc212458f927ec97286f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/12276c724a1427c72dc2dc212458f927ec97286f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/2fb0efd0052679400af0785d2ca09dcfa5b47756","verification":{"payload":"tree 12276c724a1427c72dc2dc212458f927ec97286f\nparent 1823576b12feed8560e26bb7f4b4fa70e6f2ee8c\nauthor Plamen Ivanov <plamen.ivanov01@sap.com> 1787582677 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787582677 +0300\n\nfeat(ui5-select): add ui5-option-group component for grouped options (#13913)\n\nIntroduces ui5-option-group, a new public component that allows grouping options inside ui5-select, matching the ComboBox''s ui5-combobox-item-group API pattern.\n\nKey changes:\n\nNew ui5-option-group component extending ListItemGroup, with individualSlots: true and ARIA group semantics (role=\"group\", aria-label, aria-roledescription)\nSelect._flatOptions getter flattens grouped + ungrouped options for all navigation and selection logic\nPer-group aria-setsize/aria-posinset injected via _forcedSetsize and _forcedPosinset on Option, rendered via ListItemBaseTemplate\nHidden live-region span on the Select trigger announces option count and group count on focus (aria-describedby)\nIOptionGroup interface exported from Select.ts for consumers\nWebsite docs sample added (OptionGroups)\nJIRA: BGSOFUIPIRIN-7094","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjFjVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7ewQAGQCIIUe3lZODigSj4YwXKvC\nInI53f9gyYaH4UYDF5uA/wCfv2ZrvoXy/XxBCmEAnnaxzXIXyXyG0CB2Gw0mLG7I\nbrNpJ5wj/AT1BV2iKvNzGaLpewnnBCITszrM/26W8Ivwnq40l/XneWz6M8ZgXtW0\n+1uKRH1luMOkpaOziY2cdB/ndRUZgrxq5tYIKjHiiwGKKpcZObea6Cf0mxHdiHlV\nBCjnL5weuZRpSMGaQHgIwboVGYj4dMg8vkDD07K1E8VO0UKqRjquJHL34UbL0sVK\naNEAszrP/8hoNtwUl9U19G8QewWxiw0F5Dxp3wTZ/qP6O/4wgbYasvCGNm/Wr4XY\n5Z/KHOPs3xwEASYkk0WC81jjxzq/qXAFkEpG9rRN1/qHJXKxC/edkpiMcbIxNHFW\nvpMcu8hbsqIEDxZ2/Xb+vxD/+VDSa1n6fZTY3yLyqs3mlCc53UstoP0QcfJDD8Jl\nzt8shXqVJ9su2B/HYFo9PqBIgOt1zqMYJL+pqsOso7wr3Pm6AkvzlS8BFQMPBSV9\n0GlH3plbQGUwupl0hF1JYZkvvd5g1/noSFgBU16SkexBSOvpiCzXe6btVJvp/a5a\ntOt+gqdf229OLWSFHBSfaGx4Xpw6/ixzwD0LRYnVX8/R4KHjM2ipbQ5mqUhgKtJR\nNsUK0E2yutA9+j3iXqeH\n=5PEf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-24T14:44:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url"