d":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/1823576b12feed8560e26bb7f4b4fa70e6f2ee8c","node_id":"C_kwDOCfpnRtoAKDE4MjM1NzZiMTJmZWVkODU2MGUyNmJiN2Y0YjRmYTcwZTZmMmVlOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/fc75e84a32fe4efe5eefe16de0a3df9eacb78e68","sha":"fc75e84a32fe4efe5eefe16de0a3df9eacb78e68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/fc75e84a32fe4efe5eefe16de0a3df9eacb78e68"}],"sha":"1823576b12feed8560e26bb7f4b4fa70e6f2ee8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/1823576b12feed8560e26bb7f4b4fa70e6f2ee8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22766569?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dobrinyonkov","id":22766569,"login":"dobrinyonkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzY2NTY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dobrinyonkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/fc75e84a32fe4efe5eefe16de0a3df9eacb78e68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T12:01:23Z","email":"dobrin.dimchev@sap.com","name":"Dobrin Dimchev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T12:01:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui5-list): add InactiveSelectable list item type (#13962)\n\n* feat(ui5-list): add InactiveSelectable list item type\n\nIntroduces a new `ListItemType.InactiveSelectable` enum value.\nItems of this type behave like `Inactive` (no active press feedback,\nno `item-click` event) but still allow selection (checkbox/radio)\nto be toggled when the list has a selection mode set.\n\n* chore(ui5-list): fix @since tag for InactiveSelectable to 2.26.0\n\n* test(ui5-list): add Cypress tests for InactiveSelectable type\n\n* test(ui5-list): add Enter key tests for InactiveSelectable type\n\nCover the Enter keydown path through fireItemPress, which is a\ndistinct code path from Space (keyup) and click. Adds:\n- Multiple + Enter toggles selection\n- Single + Enter selects item\n- item-click is NOT fired on Enter\n\n* fix(ui5-list): exclude SingleAuto from InactiveSelectable selection-requested\n\nSingleAuto drives selection by focus, not by click. The inverse guard\n(!None && !Delete) would fire selection-requested on click/Space/Enter\nfor SingleAuto, causing a double-fire with the focus-driven path.\n\nReplace with the intent-revealing positive check (modeSingleSelect ||\nmodeMultiple), which is consistent with how the rest of ListItem\nreasons about modes that render visible selection controls.\n\nAlso adds tests for direct checkbox/radio click and SingleAuto\nto lock in the expected behavior.\n\n* test(ui5-list): add Inactive Space/Enter regression guard\n\nThe existing regression tests only covered click. This extends them to\nSpace and Enter — the two keyboard paths through fireItemPress — and\nasserts that neither item-click nor selection-change fires for Inactive.","tree":{"sha":"45c6bd3bad920724c576e6f944c6bf5394a8e84a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/45c6bd3bad920724c576e6f944c6bf5394a8e84a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/fc75e84a32fe4efe5eefe16de0a3df9eacb78e68","verification":{"payload":"tree 45c6bd3bad920724c576e6f944c6bf5394a8e84a\nparent 8b26b366b6f8b9615503d893c0eefadd56932105\nauthor Dobrin Dimchev <dobrin.dimchev@sap.com> 1787572883 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787572883 +0300\n\nfeat(ui5-list): add InactiveSelectable list item type (#13962)\n\n* feat(ui5-list): add InactiveSelectable list item type\n\nIntroduces a new `ListItemType.InactiveSelectable` enum value.\nItems of this type behave like `Inactive` (no active press feedback,\nno `item-click` event) but still allow selection (checkbox/radio)\nto be toggled when the list has a selection mode set.\n\n* chore(ui5-list): fix @since tag for InactiveSelectable to 2.26.0\n\n* test(ui5-list): add Cypress tests for InactiveSelectable type\n\n* test(ui5-list): add Enter key tests for InactiveSelectable type\n\nCover the Enter keydown path through fireItemPress, which is a\ndistinct code path from Space (keyup) and click. Adds:\n- Multiple + Enter toggles selection\n- Single + Enter selects item\n- item-click is NOT fired on Enter\n\n* fix(ui5-list): exclude SingleAuto from InactiveSelectable selection-requested\n\nSingleAuto drives selection by focus, not by click. The inverse guard\n(!None && !Delete) would fire selection-requested on click/Space/Enter\nfor SingleAuto, causing a double-fire with the focus-driven path.\n\nReplace with the intent-revealing positive check (modeSingleSelect ||\nmodeMultiple), which is consistent with how the rest of ListItem\nreasons about modes that render visible selection controls.\n\nAlso adds tests for direct checkbox/radio click and SingleAuto\nto lock in the expected behavior.\n\n* test(ui5-list): add Inactive Space/Enter regression guard\n\nThe existing regression tests only covered click. This extends them to\nSpace and Enter — the two keyboard paths through fireItemPress — and\nasserts that neither item-click nor selection-change fires for Inactive.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjDKTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAri4QAD9BAuz56+LVZhwEEErqAk/h\nSrlXrbvGAbdJc/S5NuwbRS70QECdwyu24+soA24oAmkdxaF7F17/qCs+sMWaefsZ\nNrHsT6Ung/ONPAei4d4u18zotX5a/OA31lBNYGqjSQjEVwYhUSQtxnng+WpiVwyg\nV7YwppuuNbHnzCEssW/F9ohOGqH4B+QceiPyN0Sm6irRORPzBm8If9GP6gL12CXw\nUq/0bxrhXWOb+gb0tx3RmIsYjJR7j2x7lEYFjbrQb6kLOfmGJerVVkMiFN9E5nmU\nu96NJ0yBVNJRLVXiCr7FD0dhf0ufpQkHZwUtbxzqlh7M+QeNqa84hgdBs0m66Pst\nJ0X/CD+IVm7T3WMCD8qCopwQrZNk+UBdGa09I2Mqi0HjMmLwaFuLA5MoUcVCrGB1\nU5LfhVLBAP+Kv/4SJh5EUUWCCQxHLN5ZWblfCt9qjx2l1eDGbVIFSmWhpu5HEV9c\nwFZn9K+y0suTkPpPhS8Z7bOZNXzBwS8P2Hwa9OIL4BSg+LEoWCL29lEBIkx/CTkt\n4bueTc5Htkbdvj6/oQx2wkte6Pk2pUf2JJO9qotkoEUouVSYAGcbSIsoFXZDC+W2\nnvuqbZQBQAsD06VaT4bTyQywoPOR0DUmsHs2juEhL62BLLl4JjfP9gcAKNBWmARE\n6JCDCBCiUsQjUML0l1bV\n=dQD3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-24T12:01:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/fc75e84a32fe4efe5eefe16de0a3df9eacb78e68","node_id":"C_kwDOCfpnRtoAKGZjNzVlODRhMzJmZTRlZmU1ZWVmZTE2ZGUwYTNkZjllYWNiNzhlNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/8b26b366b6f8b9615503d893c0eefadd56932105","sha":"8b26b366b6f8b9615503d893c0eefadd56932105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/8b26b366b6f8b9615503d893c0eefadd56932105"}],"sha":"fc75e84a32fe4efe5eefe16de0a3df9eacb78e68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/fc75e84a32fe4efe5eefe16de0a3df9eacb78e68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87311182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NakataCode","id":87311182,"login":"NakataCode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzExMTgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NakataCode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/8b26b366b6f8b9615503d893c0eefadd56932105/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T11:23:21Z","email":"87311182+NakataCode@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nikola Anachkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T11:23:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-dynamic-page): ignore zero-box focus sentinels in scroll handler (#13965)\n\nProblem:\nOn Shift+Tab from a growing button, the Table''s roving-tabindex moves focus through a transient zero-height sentinel element before landing on the real row.\n\nDynamicPage.onContentFocusIn captured that sentinel and called scrollIntoView on it, scrolling the container down and hiding the focused row.\n\nSolution:\nGuard the handler to bail early when the focus target has no layout box on either axis:\n\nif (target.offsetWidth === 0 || target.offsetHeight === 0) return;\nReal focusables always have a non-zero box on both axes; sentinels do not.\n\nFixes: #13935","tree":{"sha":"99641aca189b6284e12bda7966a3b0e0da865437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/99641aca189b6284e12bda7966a3b0e0da865437"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/8b26b366b6f8b9615503d893c0eefadd56932105","verification":{"payload":"tree 99641aca189b6284e12bda7966a3b0e0da865437\nparent 67f73c11c4b715cf06612c1036c6c7ac7db3cc27\nauthor Nikola Anachkov <87311182+NakataCode@users.noreply.github.com> 1787570601 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787570601 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-dynamic-page): ignore zero-box focus sentinels in scroll handler (#13965)\n\nProblem:\nOn Shift+Tab from a growing button, the Table''s roving-tabindex moves focus through a transient zero-height sentinel element before landing on the real row.\n\nDynamicPage.onContentFocusIn captured that sentinel and called scrollIntoView on it, scrolling the container down and hiding the focused row.\n\nSolution:\nGuard the handler to bail early when the focus target has no layout box on either axis:\n\nif (target.offsetWidth === 0 || target.offsetHeight === 0) return;\nReal focusables always have a non-zero box on both axes; sentinels do not.\n\nFixes: #13935","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjCmpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiPIQAADNOXuAR2bby2NRj8Z3kHkX\nH3AJyPLrgUXEn2rzlImJXVknf3dZP2m50R0yPV/34SD4jhjb3iv4i72j3PBfbpf4\nRKTNYVjHcHouHfrLPPyi3AAvMYhlPk9WlhDc7mkIHEBEz1UeO6sQi0lKPeAuB1+T\ni+Lze6M+IiUsFBG98gq82Mz1htx3s3Ln3G+VSDBoKjpJzGmOJ2QRehTCUBUxaNFh\nJ0h6VSM6YNVCBN4k0KfmCo1WQmzxPesV0VcKsVKhTjqIL6dOk4K9pP/RMj8dV/UA\nfU7Cv34L2PCoMk4Us+xpWP/mm1jFLVa4QiTi8bczNozoFRPTq4WLoJm0S+BIQGlp\nL0qf8U4/lP9F853+TDDNobL6GartAOdian+e8nD/n4Pu2vj5ONbnQ77uxZJbs1gh\nTjTYQWCtDFXl259SM8b1T9RBxlFCjtdoolo01VQqFvhi9ZsIsiFByPs+ACXlMbd5\nWQQHmB0IoX4tCwy+z/BPonejf0zQsn7+aUTGtsFJxXFBdzdlBkly0ArI3lK5j7sW\n3DWrscALg17/03kpDrnzB2Qp29nbDGWqXhbZ/DW0Yv1Incl7AiXQ3IFwkEu08AwY\nK15/8M1Hxl8mhCJdquZo90UTvKJrQ/ua+pHeH3zW7fsxrZkstjIvemDN6xGTIj+i\nWYKrAmE8sd0KUu53uRFo\n=/J/r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-24T11:23:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UI5/webcomponents/commit/8b26b366b6f8b9615503d893c0e