s://github.com/NHristov-sap","id":53182443,"login":"NHristov-sap","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTgyNDQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NHristov-sap/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NHristov-sap/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NHristov-sap/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NHristov-sap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NHristov-sap/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NHristov-sap","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/9faf49ddecb8b2204748eb1169c407449ef4519a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T13:03:46Z","email":"n.hristov@sap.com","name":"Nikolay Hristov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T13:03:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-link): adjust focus outline in HC themes (#13968)\n\nUntil now, the outline of the border of focused `ui5-link` was -1px in High Contrast themes (Fiori 3 and Horizon) which caused focus border to go over the `ui5-link` text.\n\nThis PR adjusts the offset to 0 and the border doesn''t overlap the `ui5-link` text.\n\n<img width=\"310\" height=\"87\" alt=\"linkHC\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff082895-19d8-48de-89d8-cf52fb678738\" />","tree":{"sha":"de7ed3a487bfb933fbbe8f0827fc1f8cd1e5f23c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/de7ed3a487bfb933fbbe8f0827fc1f8cd1e5f23c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/9faf49ddecb8b2204748eb1169c407449ef4519a","verification":{"payload":"tree de7ed3a487bfb933fbbe8f0827fc1f8cd1e5f23c\nparent 168cf2233a1686dca2d0395102d0cd3ae4081b3f\nauthor Nikolay Hristov <n.hristov@sap.com> 1787317426 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787317426 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-link): adjust focus outline in HC themes (#13968)\n\nUntil now, the outline of the border