ub.com/users/SvilenDarvenyashki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SvilenDarvenyashki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/commits/cc5991cc1d2af536156f78f10d0da9401c1504ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:43:20Z","email":"106313486+SvilenDarvenyashki@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Svilen Darvenyashki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T06:43:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui5-user-settings-dialog): keep focus on navigation in single-column mode (#13953)\n\n* fix(ui5-user-settings-dialog): keep focus on navigation in single-column mode\n\n* fix(ui5-user-settings-dialog): avoid restricted for-of loop in focus lookup\n\n* fix(ui5-user-settings-dialog): focus content after async loading finishes\n\nWhen a user settings item is selected in single-column (navigation) mode\nwhile it is in loading state, defer moving the focus to the first interactive\ncontent element until the loading finishes and the content is rendered.\n\nAlso switch the focus-handling regression tests to real clicks so the list\nitem selection is triggered reliably.","tree":{"sha":"22404fa277e6362a34b2b16176fe714a17e5f4d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/trees/22404fa277e6362a34b2b16176fe714a17e5f4d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UI5/webcomponents/git/commits/cc5991cc1d2af536156f78f10d0da9401c1504ed","verification":{"payload":"tree 22404fa277e6362a34b2b16176fe714a17e5f4d9\nparent bef00ed4ef5e296d9b1dcfdbc076841226c3c82b\nauthor Svilen Darvenyashki <106313486+SvilenDarvenyashki@users.noreply.github.com> 1787208200 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787208200 +0300\n\nfix(ui5-user-settings-dialog): keep focus on navigation in single-column mode (#13953)\n\n* fix(ui5-user-settings-dialog): keep focus on navigation in single-column mode\n\n* fix(ui5-user-settings-dialog): avoid restricted for-of loop in focus lookup\n\n* fix(ui5-user-settings-dialog): focus content after async loading finishes\n\nWhen a user settings item is selected in single-column (navigation) mode\nwhile it is in loading state, defer moving the focus to the first interactive\ncontent element until the loading finishes and the content is rendered.\n\nAlso switch the focus-handling regression tests to real clicks so the list\nitem selection is triggered reliably.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhqIICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA95gQAGyPNGpqqqcKoxhyTCn+9+rH\nHPgq0YHGT4AIi6OOr8vtEjbRb05Uf258N9qIl+IDJQ+c4sP2iDDBNZOhUpEO842K\nVf1tptwNzUeTD+bmnJcdpD0xl6x3Get3MOXBkb9c86NxtKr5GD23Sdnyv8vs0pqz\nH6htujLt5rSTLphgA8ZnK3/1Lv0KOh5dlCDDJDzqH411fwq5DiAA+xkjk3CRUtZp\nmrT1/jsiFRyABAw1aAuv/awta00ONW1sQ5oJP72M67MvRaP4J14OCoaciJU9s2UH\nJGGuUgvZoBLoT3U7wFtJF87uP5nhpCRtBGnxwyh/SqfK6YsVLxOWwx+Lk9WK2sU/\n4RcUb7z7bTCfEEP1rcXQW2vgfiLyvGWkxv8kLVD+BT9blSbVvZ2NS/X7deoSs35P\nJhjtnwYcubdrzJ1JxyGKZ6v6WTM32LQoy0pQs2RBqCVB7p4Uue8viVYe+D233iIY\nchuG7JATZI8FvK+5Ejvkxfmp1Jr7i7Ws6LdPDii4/aXcoBlotbXqdcekiZN90oOB\nO0HEmMXSngnrjEM2K2QP0BNGsqQz3WNoPUYGl3nd1kgfA41XQaSUDsNCB9oyZRbK\nR3CkPjYB16w/QRC2GveRMFXQfje39fXImvwh9T+yVEZ/gZ7P4x3uf8jWC61++uW6\n1R9NXo1IQFw2CEP0K5lx\n=F0Jh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-20T06:43:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github