c1e30bef2fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wix-incubator/repluggable/commits/57372610002f6284e1179915af207c1e30bef2fc"}],"sha":"1c1c75a6b6bea8862687ac12bf55eea768131382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wix-incubator/repluggable/commits/1c1c75a6b6bea8862687ac12bf55eea768131382"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192608396?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MykhailoAlekseiev21","id":192608396,"login":"MykhailoAlekseiev21","node_id":"U_kgDOC3r4jA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MykhailoAlekseiev21","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wix-incubator/repluggable/commits/57372610002f6284e1179915af207c1e30bef2fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T15:13:33Z","email":"mykhailoa@wix.com","name":"Mykhailo Alekseiev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T15:13:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Improve error boundary logging for better error identification (#346)\n\n* Improve error boundary logging for better error identification\n\n## Changes\n\n### Issue 1: Add fallback for anonymous components\n- Add `resolveComponentName()` utility in `connectWithShell.tsx` with ''Anonymous Component'' fallback\n- Update 3 call sites to use the utility instead of inline resolution\n- Ensures component name is always present in logs (no more undefined/empty strings)\n\n### Issue 2: Fix cross-iframe error detection\n- Add `isErrorLikeObject()` type guard in new `typeGuards.ts`\n- Replace `instanceof Error` checks with duck typing approach\n- Fixes error name detection for errors thrown from iframes (e.g., DS errors in viewer frame)\n- Previously these showed as ''UnknownError'', now they preserve the actual error name\n\nFixes: https://github.com/wix-private/odeditor-packages/issues/9986\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add unit tests for isErrorLikeObject type guard\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c407b8a1ac8194d6c2cb19664d45ad0c31f394b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wix-incubator/repluggable/git/trees/5c407b8a1ac8194d6c2cb19664d45ad0c31f394b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wix-incubator/repluggable/git/commits/57372610002f6284e1179915af207c1e30bef2fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 5c407b8a1ac8194d6c2cb19664d45ad0c31f394b\nparent 0db1ddda9b74fbda528f76c55e82e22b2715fa34\nauthor Mykhailo Alekseiev <mykhailoa@wix.com> 1770822813 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770822813 +0200\n\nImprove error boundary logging for better error identification (#346)\n\n* Improve error boundary logging for better error identification\n\n## Changes\n\n### Issue 1: Add fallback for anonymous components\n- Add `resolveComponentName()` utility in `connectWithShell.tsx` with ''Anonymous Component'' fallback\n- Update 3 call sites to use the utility instead of inline resolution\n- Ensures component name is always present in logs (no more undefined/empty strings)\n\n### Issue 2: Fix cross-iframe error detection\n- Add `isErrorLikeObject()` type guard in new `typeGuards.ts`\n- Replace `instanceof Error` checks with duck typing approach\n- Fixes error name detection for errors thrown from iframes (e.g., DS errors in viewer frame)\n- Previously these showed as ''UnknownError'', now they preserve the actual error name\n\nFixes: https://github.com/wix-private/odeditor-packages/issues/9986\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add unit tests for isErrorLikeObject type guard\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjJydCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApLQQAHtFYSz1tbdTioa+AGhptsqZ\nyh7yyEqzmr03foXKsVakmxqJTjbgknCLvQRISbjCC61SMnkJKNwNiLSHsSCJ22Hj\nlQzpE4PlZtTyDf3ANzEuVAl+Ws7Gi7J/GnWj+cOTzVGDk7Z4vn3mgQZDFIFhLM0B\nM2DDknC0dCz6iyJHFdqmeTsEXjihe08rSgDnWx+yvZ/KsiIFEdHwLkuGCrkRYdci\nEJJLnK7uzGAoRxBRm9RpN5ICIHG8M2QKolXWjyoGPnJAKXHiyoXYD0Q8oztOzmuK\nQt70LT/JY18FD8POOvcAQH/2whFLgLNNQ0fE2CCLXeO3GycoLZ+Ap2l/WRQ4kPkE\nPsktPOeAVhYlrGIN+thQoT+j4p7ovLFPcGLgKqtv1zB+OSN8+ViuD0cFO2ncTbG/\nIHHQc0a21lPl85oJE+6oX+GS6iWOOfOciXE4moWnF5zastcpCN0XQa3tucD9pnfW\nhrFDqvogwwqZ1Um9mLL5KWqMc9L1dQEZGdCN8kJ2ClpufyC8kKZRKtEQPsUlpN4x\n8WuDBg5gZSmr5ElHj5aPntBd5/LfTnA6kNYvgvxTtCtSSqSuOHDDZ0CGvEylu866\nKy+Lz0mFD/+CYaABvcVoYeeRbYK2ZaQPg0NlhjD/p1bYXky8wEWegWiPEp8KXnS0\nslOvoxRvgIYDNwqj8geJ\n=Feo4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-11T15:13:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","rec