 change to reduce PR scope to the actual fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a5fc593230187199760dc624fad5c8cdfc72eff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/trees/1a5fc593230187199760dc624fad5c8cdfc72eff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/commits/11fad44c0c3a1828a7e297a202f93743ef92788e","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a5fc593230187199760dc624fad5c8cdfc72eff\nparent 164d250152369c4532c64d4a1af75386a25a44b1\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790346658 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790346658 +0200\n\nfix(nav): remove Audit Log from v1 User Access nav (#2430)\n\n* fix(nav): remove Audit Log from v1 User Access navigation\n\nRHCLOUD-49351\nThe Audit Log page only exists in v2 Access Management. Remove the\nnav item from the v1 User Access section to prevent routing to the\nwrong page (My User Access fallback).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(nav): revert LeftNavigation.tsx change (unused component)\n\nRHCLOUD-49351\nLeftNavigation.tsx is dead code — not imported anywhere.\nBoth AppEntryWithRouter and KesselAppEntryWithRouter use\nFrontendYamlNavigation which reads deploy/frontend.yaml.\nReverting this change to reduce PR scope to the actual fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtoWiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABBMQALGTyIuvpwhZcZCk+1DtfUpL\nmeO49TsLofoRV+9mH0lyoEUE0po7lyWuy4KzXzO2e040ZOipRlznHmfdE8ttlOT9\ntyIcQdrBkCAzt/K/L07X+1RjrpEd6i0eJIdEhv3HFTlQ23DvfmFcW+zSdtMThPEl\nHgPIBpvahtIjyAfuxZeDiLSybbcucbJRjdNDJAivrvZDUWKFUpETUMpXu6dFK+51\nRtBCud14HjomVmCYNgi+Sv6Q09Ad8dIWqC7zn6QORYjbBp7vKNSynRZBG2lgVoDt\npAZdI6xCAre9sZM+4y2MmoFG5iLix2k4wmsi4qQpGTBF9Y