sights-rbac-ui/commits/11fad44c0c3a1828a7e297a202f93743ef92788e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273054389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/platex-rehor-bot","id":273054389,"login":"platex-rehor-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOEEZ6tQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/platex-rehor-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/commits/164d250152369c4532c64d4a1af75386a25a44b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:22:32Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"Řehoř"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:22:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(groups): search roles by display name in wizard (#2429)\n\n* fix(groups): search roles by display name in Create Group wizard\n\nRHCLOUD-50672\nThe role filter in the Add Group wizard was searching by internal\nrole name instead of display name, making roles like Cloud\nAdministrator (internal name: sources) impossible to find by their\nuser-facing name. Align with the main Roles list by using displayName\nwith nameMatch: partial.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(groups): fix prettier formatting in RolesList\n\nRHCLOUD-50672\nBreak long filterConfig line to satisfy prettier line-length rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2840b6f282711e260f89fb27726430d08986d68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/trees/c2840b6f282711e260f89fb27726430d08986d68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/commits/164d250152369c4532c64d4a1af75386a25a44b1","verification":{"payload":"tree c2840b6f282711e260f89fb27726430d08986d68\nparent 92eb17b0ec93ee40e528044e56991323f9ddb615\nauthor Řehoř <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1790342552 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790342552 +0200\n\nfix(groups): search roles by display name in wizard (#2429)\n\n* fix(groups): search roles by display name in Create Group wizard\n\nRHCLOUD-50672\nThe role filter in the Add Group wizard was searching by internal\nrole name instead of display name, making roles like Cloud\nAdministrator (internal name: sources) impossible to find by their\nuser-facing name. Align with the main Roles list by using displayName\nwith nameMatch: partial.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(groups): fix prettier formatting in RolesList\n\nRHCLOUD-50672\nBreak long filterConfig line to satisfy prettier line-length rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtnWYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARPIQAHd76Hcp7watAAsoQN5UOqtV\nGokjgyJk6QiDnc3FcMgzxaMuobKB/HFd349A1HZu5PZ8XmUTThKWV2oFMEGV0MwV\npsCl+RTEONsIc+kQfY+p9+vyinOrxEtOXDEkXlvpMnwEgIx9oamq+n1oO2ivhKTu\nwchuC1kclen83AFqV0TFGp29v1XgAD/AzKIOR6EPbZptO6rJzLP6vjKcoGL3WZO8\nnQr0tmWPC5zPL6UbrskNc9UWUhPLkA29FHpWiUsA7R/msF9HPMl/l1pCXNW7CcRd\nJy76gz2r7tL+d4gynK1fMCbIt6UdIN+lHGPvgez