/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/commit/c6b9535f73e27fb600c577518f64e5dba07ae8f0","node_id":"C_kwDOCgaAwNoAKGM2Yjk1MzVmNzNlMjdmYjYwMGM1Nzc1MThmNjRlNWRiYTA3YWU4ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/commit/7c225515e6f3f31ee664032151f46d7cfc83bc77","sha":"7c225515e6f3f31ee664032151f46d7cfc83bc77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/commits/7c225515e6f3f31ee664032151f46d7cfc83bc77"}],"sha":"c6b9535f73e27fb600c577518f64e5dba07ae8f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/commits/c6b9535f73e27fb600c577518f64e5dba07ae8f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51095?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/martinpovolny","id":51095,"login":"martinpovolny","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinpovolny","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/commits/7c225515e6f3f31ee664032151f46d7cfc83bc77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:09:15Z","email":"martin.povolny@gmail.com","name":"Martin Povolny"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:09:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(roles): make cost management resource definitions optional (#2411)\n\n* fix(scripts): support commander v12 in createDataJson\n\n* fix(roles): make cost management resource definitions optional\n\nRemove mandatory resource validation from the Cost Management resource\ndefinitions step in both v1 and v2 role creation wizards. The RBAC backend\nand Koku backend treat empty resourceDefinitions as unrestricted (wildcard)\naccess across all resources.\n\nWhen no resources exist for a permission, display that the permission applies\nto all resources rather than blocking role creation with an error. Also update\nthe review and summary steps to display ''All resources'' when no specific resources\nare defined.\n\n* fix(roles): derive cost resource availability from unfiltered options\n\nDecouple hasOptions and placeholder from filteredOptions so typing\na query with no matches does not disable the selector or flip the\nplaceholder to ''No resources available (applies to all)''.\n\nInclude resourceTypes query loading state in isLoadingResources.\nRender disabled ''No results found'' option in SelectList when filtered\nresults are empty. Prevent infinite re-render loop by memoizing\nsetOptions in reducer.\n\nAdd unit tests for v1 and v2 CostResources covering loading, empty\navailability, and search filter behavior.\n\n* fix(groups): pass count to service account notification titles\n\naddGroupServiceAccountsSuccessTitle and addGroupServiceAccountsErrorTitle\ndefine ICU plural messages that require the count parameter. Without it,\nreact-intl emits a format error and renders the message verbatim with\ntemplate placeholders, causing Storybook test assertions to fail.","tree":{"sha":"3c07ab7c0f1197aa97afe3cfed7212e14a18aa72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/trees/3c07ab7c0f1197aa97afe3cfed7212e14a18aa72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/commits/7c225515e6f3f31ee664032151f46d7cfc83bc77","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c07ab7c0f1197aa97afe3cfed7212e14a18aa72\nparent 80ebbd7874fd89e10f0910be11021e2932c8c966\nauthor Martin Povolny <martin.povolny@gmail.com> 1788959355 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788959355 +0200\n\nfix(roles): make cost management resource definitions optional (#2411)\n\n* fix(scripts): support commander v12 in createDataJson\n\n* fix(roles): make cost management resource definitions optional\n\nRemove mandatory resource validation from the Cost Management resource\ndefinitions step in both v1 and v2 role creation wizards. The RBAC backend\nand Koku backend treat empty resourceDefinitions as unrestricted (wildcard)\naccess across all resources.\n\nWhen no resources exist for a permission, display that the permission applies\nto all resources rather than blocking role creation with an error. Also update\nthe review and summary steps to display ''All resources'' when no specific resources\nare defined.\n\n* fix(roles): derive cost resource availability from unfiltered options\n\nDecouple hasOptions and placeholder from filteredOptions so typing\na query with no matches does not disable the selector or flip the\nplaceholder to ''No resources available (applies to all)''.\n\nInclude resourceTypes query loading state in isLoadingResources.\nRender disabled ''No results found'' option in SelectList when filtered\nresults are empty. Prevent infinite re-render loop by memoizing\nsetOptions in reducer.\n\nAdd unit tests for v1 and v2 CostResources covering loading, empty\navailability, and search filter behavior.\n\n* fix(groups): pass count to service account notification titles\n\naddGroupServiceAccountsSuccessTitle and addGroupServiceAccountsErrorTitle\ndefine ICU plural messages that require the count parameter. Without it,\nreact-intl emits a format error and renders the message verbatim with\ntemplate placeholders, causing Storybook test assertions to fail.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoVp7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA82MQAK/JCaGbn6ePv9dGp1w20nDl\np3paw9Bp/otImuO56+e/3CtW1CBD2EkoZPQsiTgB2WBn2jTXakCuJLV5SH8O946T\ncIUIPpMZ7XYC6TaHXxQWtakrvqlp6vOhxMeFMGR39mpMppi+je7Ytzsnj/6iJI7u\nBj3uZ1mGVMVbiPM/h2QM74hActFU+Cy9eDiQOWn9sjKXEzI3/OLy2Dt55qoHjg4J\nC0R3vYSahx7ifk/JllN+RtgJluH6TLS7sxHWANrFTZU+qnGVMeKY4XhfYXWOHQvU\nW0mq8STTLd63MmJaMdX2BuY5nGVo4DabohSXNwMm3HnbrdF/FKt2OjuXwnlCbVYV\nITBBhKE7XvsIUi+acuur9ax8vTES5BACb5zRidi++P9ai5bV7pFGIs8WQYGS9K+f\nhrAqIZKtM/8IS3iGmMExZGEDsGP2xS/U4jNfRpNjn9Bj+USrXQ9GIWDLNo2KW54c\nEnM69t6iJx+lrENOlnfW+Bx5HJh5pc+/pakEN7t/uSqPGsHDNpwUhEGMMslPwAI9\nroG7n80b3RChOjQ5PwZcL2kd7nxeCFI5+w09fOnmc6XvugWxX3mLqFd09j7oKTrP\nHTDmEyYsEC07+b9udooD6M6MI+Lx6hCoYX2A/pKdfHKlUfsbKAUzHcMJ/an0YBsc\nteBlgHN2pz/vPF9HpM8z\n=Se7I\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T13:09:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h