:{"date":"2026-08-08T07:21:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: adopt experience-ui-governance for shared lint and hooks [RHCLOUD-50105] (#2399)\n\nReplace locally duplicated ESLint rules with the shared plugin from\nexperience-ui-governance. Migrate all raw useFlag() calls to semantic\nfeature detection hooks in src/capabilities/. Add boundary violation\nand jest snapshot rules. ESLint config spreads governance preset\narrays instead of duplicating restricted-import paths.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8d56ea59b4a69b2e9070a2561229424d391c698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/trees/a8d56ea59b4a69b2e9070a2561229424d391c698"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/commits/ed38b077cd29323b42bf6eee1a6771edbb2a27d8","verification":{"payload":"tree a8d56ea59b4a69b2e9070a2561229424d391c698\nparent f17108e2e444ca447dd00699b796ea2026b90e84\nauthor Riccardo Forina <rforina@redhat.com> 1786173687 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786173687 +0200\n\nfeat: adopt experience-ui-governance for shared lint and hooks [RHCLOUD-50105] (#2399)\n\nReplace locally duplicated ESLint rules with the shared plugin from\nexperience-ui-governance. Migrate all raw useFlag() calls to semantic\nfeature detection hooks in src/capabilities/. Add boundary violation\nand jest snapshot rules. ESLint config spreads governance preset\narrays instead of duplicating restricted-import paths.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdtj3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPoIQAGc0VURd4pWx7UQWQ0uSXTas\nJTzFjsCq/V3hCVYbqXX3fyyCJVQGfAZKz0+1rNxVOB/O0BXeS0MTgyE+BQzOe/BP\n76lFRLxWnsClfIpavkyWuN97mvsOxh4rPadJ+UK1jVAUiQ+E6wfhX+IsCUweU5Sm\nW32BACUUqrEccpV1GyHXuUdHiQ5Y80bWCeekvysvdQVEWW3V1tDjT7DvQJPSXMh9\nrnlcQkE+mpwqSSUMSjEdGwC3J6jR6UrJfD1W05vwRjZKPxiz3AUMX