-rbac-ui/commits/c04b9480e10a554be6b68a2da6877ce31e59dc2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:47:36Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T16:23:21Z","email":"platform-experience-services@redhat.com","name":"platex-rehor-bot"},"message":"fix(ci): remove vestigial Jenkins/Travis CI build scripts\n\nRHCLOUD-49843\n\nDelete build_deploy.sh, pr_check.sh, .travis.yml, and .travis/\ndirectory. These legacy scripts source remote shell code from\ninsights-frontend-builder-common@master without commit-SHA pinning,\ncreating a supply-chain risk. Konflux (.tekton/) is now the primary\nbuild system, making these Jenkins/Travis entrypoints dead code.\n\nAlso remove Travis CI badge from README and clean up related\nCODEOWNERS and .gitignore entries.\n\nThe build-tools submodule is retained as it is actively used by\nKonflux pipeline Dockerfiles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"518988152c85229d99eee73adc48cc5867c5bed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/trees/518988152c85229d99eee73adc48cc5867c5bed3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-rbac-ui/git/commits/c04b9480e10a554be6b68a2da6877ce31e59dc2f","verification":{"payload":"tree 518988152c85229d99eee73adc48cc5867c5bed3\nparent 069eda6fd875361811ebbff7b3aad2b4fc2d2da3\nauthor platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1785779256 +0000\ncommitter platex-rehor-bot <platform-experience-services@redhat.com> 1785947001 +0000\n\nfix(ci): remove vestigial Jenkins/Travis CI build scripts\n\nRHCLOUD-49843\n\nDelete build_deploy.sh, pr_check.sh, .travis.yml, and .travis/\ndirectory. These legacy scripts source remote shell code from\ninsights-frontend-builder-common@master without commit-SHA pinning,\ncreating a supply-chain risk. Konflux (.tekton/) is now the primary\nbuild system, making these Jenkins/Travis entrypoin